cisive run.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/01/sports/baseball/this-time-the-mets-win-a-long-one.html', 'snippet': 'For the second day in a row, the Mets played a 14-inning game, but on Saturday they pulled out a victory over the Phillies, with David Wright singling in the decisive run.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHILADELPHIA — The Mets were asking much of Jacob deGrom without much to offer him in return. Their bullpen was depleted and their spirit broken after a loss in 14 innings the night before, and now they were asking him to pitch deep into their game against the Philadelphia Phillies, to be effective and efficient and essentially carry the team. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/01/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1397, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/01/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Another Slog for Mets, but This Time, It’s Worth It', 'kicker': 'Mets 5, Phillies 4, 14 Innings', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Another Slog for Mets, but This Time, It’s Worth It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Philadelphia Phillies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'deGrom, Jacob', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-01T01:35:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Rohan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/565befea-60e0-58f7-8f5a-0e8426a86480', 'word_count': 783, 'uri': 'nyt://article/565befea-60e0-58f7-8f5a-0e8426a86480'}, {'abstract': 'The military first used drones, armed checkpoints and raids on suspected militant strongholds to try to find Pfc. Bowe Bergdahl, according to classified military logs given to WikiLeaks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/01/us/timeline-how-us-army-finds-missing-soldiers-bergdahl-pow-wikileaks-documents-details.html', 'snippet': 'The military first used drones, armed checkpoints and raids on suspected militant strongholds to try to find Pfc. Bowe Bergdahl, according to classified military logs given to WikiLeaks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the United States Army in eastern Afghanistan discovered that one of its soldiers, Pfc. Bowe Bergdahl, was missing in action, it began a frantic search. As detailed in the classified military logs given to WikiLeaks by Pfc. Bradley Manning, now Chelsea Manning, the initial hunt for the captured sergeant included surveillance drones, armed checkpoints and infantry raids on suspected militant strongholds. Intercepts of Taliban communications included in the military records reveal that the militants immediately thought to use the capture for propaganda purposes, and derided American forces for looking in all the wrong places. Andrew W. Lehren ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Soldier Is Missing. What Comes Next?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bergdahl, Bowe R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisoners of War', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WikiLeaks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Chelsea', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Army', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-01T01:38:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'List', '_id': 'nyt://article/5df6d3f0-ce2d-5e38-911b-63c1b1056cea', 'word_count': 927, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5df6d3f0-ce2d-5e38-911b-63c1b1056cea'}, {'abstract': 'In this episode of “Orpha