rcest, and has big implications for shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Do you think Kelli O’Hara will score a big upset next Sunday and win the Tony Award for best actress in a musical for Broadway’s “Bridges of Madison County”? Or will front-runner Jessie Mueller and “Beautiful: The Carole King Musical” emerge dominant, with the show winning the Tony for best musical over “A Gentleman’s Guide to Love & Murder”? As we survey the 800 Tony voters this week for our annual predictions story, we’re adding new voices to the mix: Yours.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/theater/01actress/01actress-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 304, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/01/theater/01actress/01actress-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 304}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/theater/01actress/01actress-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 519, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/theater/01actress/01actress-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1038, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/theater/01actress/01actress-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/01/theater/01actress/01actress-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/theater/01actress/01actress-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'widt