 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/02/arts/music/lower-a-copenhagen-band-at-the-acheron-in-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'Lower has the noisy, hopeful drive toward reinvention, toward finding value in its own guesswork, impulses, mistakes, openness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is great meaning in the post-punk reaction, as there is always great meaning in the reaction of any child toward unstable parents. That reaction wasn’t confined to one period of time. It didn’t stop in, say, 1981. Punk, behind sound, is declarative and self-annihilating at the same time. It wants to assert itself and to disappear, and has done so, in regular overlapping cycles, all over the place, for all kinds of reasons. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/02/arts/lower/lower-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/02/arts/lower/lower-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/02/arts/lower/lower-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/02/arts/lower/lower-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1107, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/02/arts/lower/lower-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/02/arts/lower/lower-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'ca