 1940, before the United States entered World War II. He was killed the following year in a midair collision over England. He was all of 19.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Challenger, Columbia and the Nature of Calamity', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Columbia (Space Shuttle)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Challenger (Space Shuttle)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Aeronautics and Space Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space and Astronomy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vaughan, Diane', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-02T02:54:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Clyde Haberman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Clyde', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haberman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6701dcda-0ff5-5c8d-8c82-3245c6abcba8', 'word_count': 1048, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6701dcda-0ff5-5c8d-8c82-3245c6abcba8'}, {'abstract': 'A man stabbed two children in a Brooklyn housing development on Sunday evening, killing a 6-year-old boy and leaving a 7-year-old girl in critical condition, the police said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/02/nyregion/boy-6-dies-after-a-stabbing-in-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'A man stabbed two children in a Brooklyn housing development on Sunday evening, killing a 6-year-old boy and leaving a 7-year-old girl in critical condition, the police said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mikayla Capers and her best friend, Prince Joshua Avitto, wanted to get Icees. The two hopped in an elevator on Sunday at the Brooklyn housing project where they lived. A man got on after them, pulled out a knife and stabbed the children, the police said, in an attack that left residents stunned.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/03/nyregion/stabbing-2/stabbing-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 541, 'width': 372, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/03/nyregion/stabbing-2/stabbing-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 541, 'width': 372, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/03/nyregion/stabbing-2/stabbing-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/03/nyregion/stabbing-2/stabbing-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/03/nyregion/stabbing-2/stabbing-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Boy, 6, Dies After a Stabbing in Brooklyn', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Boy, 6, Dies After a Stabbing in Brooklyn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East New York (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam