g reform efforts and may prove to be unconstitutional, David Zaring writes in Another View.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most businesses cannot make plans without making predictions about what their regulators will do. Some have argued that this task has been complicated by the fact that old regulations are rarely repealed, even as new ones are added, making for overlapping requirements and outdated regulations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/business/dbpix-capitol-hill/dbpix-capitol-hill-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/04/business/dbpix-capitol-hill/dbpix-capitol-hill-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/business/dbpix-capitol-hill/dbpix-capitol-hill-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/business/dbpix-capitol-hill/dbpix-capitol-hill-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1395, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/business/dbpix-capitol-hill/dbpix-capitol-hill-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/04/business/dbpix-capitol-hill/dbpix-capitol-hill-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/business/dbpix-capitol-hill/dbpix-capitol-hill-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'w