h': 'Humans of New York is a photoblog that uses street photography to document the lives of all sorts of people living in the big apple. With nearly 6 million likes on Facebook, the project has started a storytelling revolution and produced a New York Times bestselling book.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Portraits of People in Myanmar', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-03T17:28:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicole Sganga', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicole', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sganga', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6251e342-763d-5468-a139-7779c3c99a18', 'word_count': 796, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6251e342-763d-5468-a139-7779c3c99a18'}, {'abstract': 'Wondermint and Kringle Cream are two of the state’s liqueurs making appearances in several summer drink creations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/04/dining/wisconsin-spirits-meet-new-york-cocktails.html', 'snippet': 'Wondermint and Kringle Cream are two of the state’s liqueurs making appearances in several summer drink creations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fedora, the snug basement restaurant in Greenwich Village, has named one drink after a town in south-central Wisconsin — the Lake Delton Mule — and another, the Root Beer Butterfest Float, for an annual dairy festival in Reedsburg, Wis. Fedora’s nearby sister restaurant, Perla, serves a cocktail called National Lampoon’s Wisco Vacation, no explanation needed.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/dining/04LIQUEUR/04LIQUEUR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 834, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/04/dining/04LIQUEUR/04LIQUEUR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 834}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/dining/04LIQUEUR/04LIQUEUR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/dining/04LIQUEUR/04LIQUEUR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1769, 'width': 1272, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/dining/04LIQUEUR/04LIQUEUR-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/04/dining/04LIQUEUR/04LIQUEUR-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/dining/04LIQUEUR/04LIQUEUR-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Wisconsin Spirits, Meet New York Cocktails', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Summer Sippers from Wisconsin', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simonson, Robert', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wisconsin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Liquor', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Perla (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)'