bany on Sept. 9 and end in Seattle on Oct. 6. There will be three performances at the Best Buy Theater in Manhattan, Sept. 18-20.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Latest Incarnation of King Crimson Plans U.S. Tour', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New King Crimson Plans a U.S. Tour', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fripp, Robert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'King Crimson', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALBANY (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Seattle (Wash)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-03T18:14:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/042b386d-aa9f-56e1-9934-3b44cdd20d1e', 'word_count': 204, 'uri': 'nyt://article/042b386d-aa9f-56e1-9934-3b44cdd20d1e'}, {'abstract': 'Ford reveals its new Troller T4 S.U.V. for Brazil; Volkswagen is likely to triple its S.U.V. lineup as it pursues global sales dominance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/04/automobiles/wheelies-the-trolling-for-trails-edition.html', 'snippet': 'Ford reveals its new Troller T4 S.U.V. for Brazil; Volkswagen is likely to triple its S.U.V. lineup as it pursues global sales dominance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A roundup of motoring news from the web:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't