5cc8-5a84-9282-d99ae57cb412'}, {'abstract': 'A compulsion to repeat emerged as a common theme as colleagues of the choreographer DD Dorvillier presented solos at Danspace last weekend.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/04/arts/dance/solos-by-dd-dorvilliers-colleagues-at-st-marks-church.html', 'snippet': 'A compulsion to repeat emerged as a common theme as colleagues of the choreographer DD Dorvillier presented solos at Danspace last weekend.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Diary of an Image by DD Dorvillier”: that’s the title of the four-week program currently underway at Danspace Project at St. Mark’s Church. But not all the work is by Ms. Dorvillier. On Friday and Saturday, for the second of two weekends, the choreographer invited colleagues to present solos of their own. Commonalities between the pieces appeared coincidental, except perhaps for purposeful awkwardness and a compulsion to repeat.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/arts/solos2/solos2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/04/arts/solos2/solos2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/arts/solos2/solos2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/arts/solos2/solos2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/arts/solos2/solos2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,