e623', 'word_count': 355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1eb111f1-0d37-5f65-ad3b-ce9cd9fce623'}, {'abstract': 'The Tiananmen protests of 25 years ago are well documented, but less well known are the protests took place across China, paralyzing cities large and small for nearly two months that spring.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/03/upheaval-extended-beyond-beijing/', 'snippet': 'The Tiananmen protests of 25 years ago are well documented, but less well known are the protests took place across China, paralyzing cities large and small for nearly two months that spring.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They were the children of poor farmers and factory workers, the first in their families to attend college, and for that they were grateful. But in the spring of 1989, the students at Hubei University, a provincial college in the Yangtze River city of Wuhan, were jaded beyond their years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/03/world/03sino-wuhan02/03sino-wuhan02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/03/world/03sino-wuhan02/03sino-wuhan02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/03/world/03sino-wuhan02/03sino-wuhan02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/03/world/03sino-wuhan02/03sino-wuhan02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1357, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/03/world/03sino-wuhan02/03sino-wuhan02-thumbStanda