': 'The crew of the Gulfstream IV jet that crashed in Bedford on Saturday night made comments about aircraft control before the plane exploded, killing all on board, federal investigators said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The crew of the Gulfstream IV jet that crashed in Bedford on Saturday night made comments about aircraft control before the plane ran off the runway and exploded, according to federal investigators analyzing the cockpit voice recorder and the flight data recorder on Tuesday. An investigator did not specify the nature of the comments. The investigator also said that a crew member had indicated the plane was ready to lift off, but it was unclear why the aircraft failed to do so. All seven people on board were killed. The flight data recorder indicated that the jet reached 165 knots, and that brake pressure rose and the aircraft decelerated before it careered into a gully. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Massachusetts: Details Emerge on Fatal Jet Crash', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | New England', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Massachusetts: Details Emerge On Jet Crash ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-04T00:25:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/f01276a4-afb2-509d-9882-295bcd2