 {'abstract': 'The State Senate agreed to Gov. Rick Snyder’s call for spending millions in state money to spare the pensions of Detroit retirees from deeper cuts, a proposal approved last month by the House.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/04/us/michigan-senate-passes-plan-to-ease-detroit-pension-cuts.html', 'snippet': 'The State Senate agreed to Gov. Rick Snyder’s call for spending millions in state money to spare the pensions of Detroit retirees from deeper cuts, a proposal approved last month by the House.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Michigan Senate on Tuesday agreed to Gov. Rick Snyder’s call for spending millions in state funds to spare the pensions of Detroit retirees from deeper cuts and to avoid the sale of artworks from the city’s museum, part of a larger bargain aimed at bringing a swift close to the nation’s largest municipal bankruptcy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Michigan Senate Passes Plan to Ease Detroit Pension Cuts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'State Senate Passes Plan to Ease Cuts Detroit Faces', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snyder, Richard Dale', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Orr, Kevyn D', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Michigan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Institute of Arts', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Employees', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-04T01:37:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'N