n Video of Freed U.S. Soldier', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosenberg, Matthew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bergdahl, Bowe R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisoners of War', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-04T10:53:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew Rosenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d0c0c8c-a4ca-5a45-9b6b-d379e3c5d3b0', 'word_count': 1276, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d0c0c8c-a4ca-5a45-9b6b-d379e3c5d3b0'}, {'abstract': 'Ariel Kaminer shares her experiences reporting on the harsh conditions workers faced during the construction of New York University’s Abu Dhabi campus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2014/06/04/the-path-to-workers-and-their-stories-in-abu-dhabi/', 'snippet': 'Ariel Kaminer shares her experiences reporting on the harsh conditions workers faced during the construction of New York University’s Abu Dhabi campus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last month, Ariel Kaminer wrote about the harsh conditions that construction workers faced during the building of the New York University campus in Abu Dhabi. A reporter on the Metro desk, she usually measures her travel expenses in subway fares. Here she tells of the challenges and rewards of reporting a story that is far from