s, but the designer says she has no plans to move aside.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the fashion designer Donna Karan debuted her most recent collection in February, it was a high-voltage affair: a specially commissioned film by Steven Sebring playing in the background as models strutted on stage in negligee-like outfits paired with square-shouldered jackets and tall boots. In the audience, a smattering of boldface names: Katie Holmes, Trudie Styler and Rita Ora, all sheathed head to toe in Donna Karan. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/fashion/05KARAN_SPAN-copy/05zKARAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/05/fashion/05KARAN_SPAN-copy/05zKARAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/fashion/05KARAN_SPAN-copy/05zKARAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/fashion/05KARAN_SPAN-copy/05zKARAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/fashion/05KARAN_SPAN-copy/05zKARAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/05/fashion/05KARAN_SPAN-copy/05zKARAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/fashion/05KA