': None, 'lastname': 'Lasky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/3730cda2-cc85-50b3-b07d-3cbc7942d0ac', 'word_count': 807, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3730cda2-cc85-50b3-b07d-3cbc7942d0ac'}, {'abstract': 'Spanish conductor Raphael Fruhbeck de Burgos announces retirement from conducting', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/04/raphael-fruhbeck-de-burgos-citing-illness-withdraws-from-conducting/', 'snippet': 'Spanish conductor Raphael Fruhbeck de Burgos announces retirement from conducting', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rafael Frühbeck de Burgos, the veteran Spanish conductor, has cancer and is giving up conducting immediately on the advice of his doctors, the Boston Symphony Orchestra said on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Raphael Fruhbeck de Burgos, Citing Illness, Withdraws from Conducting', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fruhbeck de Burgos, Rafael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Symphony Orchestra', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-04T22:47:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d9dc4a9-2d92-50a3-a1a2-b34eaf27a80b', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d9dc4a9-2d92-50a3-a1a2-b34eaf27a80b'}, {'abstract': 'An accessories collection starts with the dining room and promises to move steadily through the house.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/05/garden/taking-one-room-at-a-time.html', 'snippet': 'An accessories collection starts with the dining room and promises to move steadily through the house.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Department of Decoration made its debut last month at a dinner party at the High Line Hotel. Tables were set with powder-coated flatware and serving trays, smooth slab ceramic plates and printed table linens, all created by the husband-and-wife team of Brian Kaspr and Payton Cosell Turner, who already make wallpaper under the name Flat Vernacular.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/garden/05CURR5/05CURR5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/05/garden/05CURR5/05CURR5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 719}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/garden/05CURR5/05CURR5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1012, 'width': 844, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/garden/05CURR5/05CURR5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1012, 'width': 844, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/garden/05CURR5/05CURR5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/05/garden/05CURR5/05CURR5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/garden/05CURR5/