 and good seats for a Paul Simon concert.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/04/cooperstown-on-the-field-behind-the-scenes/', 'snippet': 'A Tauck trip to Cooperstown, N.Y., will include an after-hours tour of the Baseball Hall of Fame, a pick-up game at Doubleday Field, and good seats for a Paul Simon concert.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Cooperstown, N.Y., while the National Baseball Hall of Fame and Museum is waving pennants in honor of its 75th anniversary, Tauck will offer virtual behind-home-plate access to sports celebrities and special events in a four-day trip.The Tauck Baseball Event, July 31 to Aug. 3, offers guests third- and fourth-row seating at a 75th anniversary concert featuring Paul Simon as headliner. An after-hours tour and talk at the Baseball Hall of Fame includes a keynote address and question and answer session with the “Baseball” documentary filmmaker Ken Burns, who designed the trip with Tauck.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/travel/04cooperstown/04cooperstown-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/04/travel/04cooperstown/04cooperstown-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 685}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/travel/04cooperstown/04cooperstown-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 861, 'width': 754, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/travel/04cooperstown/04cooperstown-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 861, 'width': 754, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/travel/