ociation declined to vote on a measure asking the State Department to pressure Israel not to erect obstacles to Americans’ teaching at Palestinian universities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A resolution critical of Israel failed to win approval from a leading scholarly group, the Modern Language Association, the group said on Wednesday, after an overwhelming majority of its members declined to vote.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scholars’ Bid to Criticize Israel’s Actions Is Rejected', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Scholars’ Bid to Criticize Israel Actions Is Rejected', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Modern Language Assn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robbins, Bruce', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-05T00:19:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a568dd5d-120e-5e94-82ad-f466b39bedac', 'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a568dd5d-120e-5e94-82ad-f466b39bedac'}, {'abstract': 'Regulars at Belmont Park bemoan the frenzied throngs that are expected to turn out on Saturday for California Chrome’s bid for the Triple Crown, preferring the racetrack’s slower pace.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/05/nyregion/the-other-sides