nyt://article/2972190e-8350-55a3-821f-f2e4f61c40f8'}, {'abstract': 'After a seven-game showdown in last season’s N.B.A. finals, the Heat and the Spurs left their cores intact, but they have continued adapting on the way to a rematch.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/05/sports/basketball/nba-finalists-once-more-heat-and-spurs-show-their-adaptability.html', 'snippet': 'After a seven-game showdown in last season’s N.B.A. finals, the Heat and the Spurs left their cores intact, but they have continued adapting on the way to a rematch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the second straight year, the Miami Heat and the San Antonio Spurs will meet in the N.B.A. finals, and it will again be easy to cast them as polar opposites: the old-school Spurs with their homegrown crop of stars — Tim Duncan, Tony Parker and Manu Ginobili were all drafted by San Antonio — against the modern mercenaries from Miami, including the transplants LeBron James and Chris Bosh.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/BECKLEY-SILO/BECKLEY-SILO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/BECKLEY-SILO/BECKLEY-SILO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 697}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/BECKLEY-SILO/BECKLEY-SILO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 882, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/BECKLEY-SILO/BECKLEY-SILO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1763, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 