05/sports/baseball/don-zimmer-dies-at-83-after-a-lifetime-in-baseball.html', 'snippet': 'As player, coach and manager, Zimmer was variously associated with the Brooklyn Dodgers, the Mets, the Red Sox and the Yankees. He was even married on a baseball diamond.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Don Zimmer, the stubby, Popeye-muscled baseball lifer with the unforgettable jowls whose passion for the game endured through 66 years as a player, manager, coach and adviser, died on Wednesday in Dunedin, Fla. He was 83.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-ZIMMER-1/CITY-ZIMMER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 465, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-ZIMMER-1/CITY-ZIMMER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 465}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-ZIMMER-1/CITY-ZIMMER-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 794, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-ZIMMER-1/CITY-ZIMMER-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1573, 'width': 2029, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-ZIMMER-1/CITY-ZIMMER-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-ZIMMER-1/CITY-ZIMMER-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-ZIMMER-1/CITY-ZIMMER-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'heigh