 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/05/sports/baseball/a-four-run-third-and-then-more-of-the-usual-for-the-yankees.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees fell to the Athletics, their fifth defeat in six games, as they continued struggling on offense, but the game was eclipsed by the news of Don Zimmer’s death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Around the sixth inning of the Yankees’ loss to the Oakland Athletics on Wednesday, Derek Jeter was told of the death of Don Zimmer. Suddenly, any attempt to come back in the game became much more difficult. There was grief to overcome in the Yankees’ dugout.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 467}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 797, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1594, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': No