itical” to remove the final 7.2 percent of the arsenal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Acknowledging that Syria will miss the June 30 deadline for eliminating its chemical weapons, the top United Nations official overseeing the arsenal’s eradication said Wednesday it was “very, very critical” for Syria to export the final shipment, which is packed and ready to go but is trapped in an area contested by insurgents in the civil war.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Official Urges Syria to Finish Chemical Arms Disposal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Official Urges Syria to Finish Chemical Arms Disposal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Biological and Chemical Warfare', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaag, Sigrid', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARMS CONTROL AND LIMITATION AND DISARMAMENT', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Organization for the Prohibition of Chemical Weapons', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-05T03:24:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone and Nick Cumming-Bruce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_mat