ions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/05/sports/basketball/a-familiar-ring-for-members-of-heat-and-spurs.html', 'snippet': 'When the San Antonio Spurs meet the Miami Heat in the N.B.A. finals, Tim Duncan, Dwyane Wade and others will have a chance to add to substantial jewelry collections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Championships can define careers. Bill Russell’s 11 rings are often used as a trump card in arguments about greatness, while Charles Barkley’s and Patrick Ewing’s reputations suffered because those stars never won it all.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/basketball/05hoffman-5rings/05hoffman-5rings-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/basketball/05hoffman-5rings/05hoffman-5rings-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 683}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/basketball/05hoffman-5rings/05hoffman-5rings-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 656, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/basketball/05hoffman-5rings/05hoffman-5rings-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 656, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/basketball/05hoffman-5rings/05hoffman-5rings-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/05/sports/basketball/05hoffman-5rings/05hoffman-5rings-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh