'As Sgt. Bowe Bergdahl was released, a Maryland woman was dismayed to learn that a prisoner swap would not include her husband who had been taken hostage in Pakistan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/05/us/politics/dismay-at-failure-of-swap-to-rescue-more-hostages.html', 'snippet': 'As Sgt. Bowe Bergdahl was released, a Maryland woman was dismayed to learn that a prisoner swap would not include her husband who had been taken hostage in Pakistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Elaine Weinstein received a message from the White House on Saturday morning telling her to be ready for a phone call from a senior Obama administration official.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dismay at Failure of Swap to Rescue More Hostages', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dismay at Failure of Swap to Rescue More Hostages', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmidt, Michael S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hostages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Barter', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weinstein, Warren', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bergd