rate to 0.15 percent, a record low.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/06/business/international/european-central-bank-cuts-interest-rate.html', 'snippet': 'The central bank cut its benchmark interest rate to 0.15 percent, a record low.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRANKFURT — Banks typically make money on the cash they park at a central bank. Now the European Central Bank wants them to pay for the privilege. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'European Central Bank Breaks New Ground to Press Growth', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'European Central Bank Breaks New Ground to Press Growth', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Irwin, Neil', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deflation (Economics)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Euro (Currency)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-05T11:51:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Ewing and Neil Irwin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Irwin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b2d0686-907e-5f8b-a6e3-f310bf8415f7', 'word_count': 1031, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b2d0686-907e-5f8b-a6e3-f310bf8415f7'}, {'abstract': 'The heart of “Orange Is the New Black” is Pi