0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2590263b-aed3-5296-b298-c73f5ec84156', 'word_count': 106, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2590263b-aed3-5296-b298-c73f5ec84156'}, {'abstract': 'The authorities in New Brunswick said that they had identified the man who killed three Mounties and wounded two others.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/06/world/americas/police-hunt-killer-of-canadian-officers.html', 'snippet': 'The authorities in New Brunswick said that they had identified the man who killed three Mounties and wounded two others.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OTTAWA — A full day after a heavily armed gunman killed three police officers and wounded two others, Moncton, New Brunswick, largely remained under siege on Thursday night.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Canadian Police Seek Suspect in Killing of Officers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Canadian Police Seek Suspect in Killing of Officers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Austen, Ian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Royal Canadian Mounted Police', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Brunswick (Canada)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bourque, Justin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Moncton (New Brunswick)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-05T13:29:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 's