 to their weekly menu, and with making the most of their new C.S.A. (community supported agriculture) share. I am leading the way, holding a crash course in creating substantial vegetarian meals using pantry staples, the seasonal vegetables that come every week in the C.S.A. box, and ingredients from nearby supermarkets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/us/motherlode-chopping/motherlode-chopping-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 520, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/us/motherlode-chopping/motherlode-chopping-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 520, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/us/motherlode-chopping/motherlode-chopping-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/04/us/motherlode-chopping/motherlode-chopping-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/04/us/motherlode-chopping/motherlode-chopping-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Brawny Vegetarian Soup Holds Its Own With Meat Lovers', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheese', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kale (Vegetable)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lentils', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soups', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetables', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetarianism', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-05T14:03:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha Rose Shulman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': 'Rose', 'lastname': 'Shulman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e11aeed-ebfc-5574-860a-02f567fac09f', 'word_count': 1303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e11aeed-ebfc-5574-860a-02f567fac09f'}, {'abstract': 'The threat of stronger economic sanctions lurks behind the deadline, but the tough talk did little to stifle world leaders’ desire to meet individually with President Vladimir V. Putin of Russia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/06/world/group-of-7-condemns-its-absent-partner-russia.html', 'snippet': 'The threat of stronger economic sanctions lurks behind the deadline, but the tough talk did little to stifle world leaders’ desire to meet individually with President Vladimir V. Putin of Russia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — With the backing of other world leaders, President Obama effectively set a one-month deadline for Moscow to reverse its intervention in Ukraine and help quash a pro-Russian separatist uprising or else he said it would face international sanctions far more severe than anything it had endured so far.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Group of 7 Backing, Obama Gives Russia One-Month Ukraine Deadline', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Group of 7 Backing, Obama Gives Russia One-Month Ukraine Deadline', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baker, Peter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Group of Seven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-05T14:16:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3fbd934-b583-58b6-b3cc-2f764455a483', 'word_count': 1106, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c3fbd934-b583-58b6-b3cc-2f764455a483'}, {'abstract': 'In the country’s capital, situated between Sydney and Melbourne, you’ll find everything from culture to cycling, political history to panoramic views.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/08/travel/36-hours-in-canberra-australia.html', 'snippet': 'In the country’s capital, situated between Sydney and Melbourne, you’ll find everything from culture to cycling, political history to panoramic views.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To stand atop a Canberra hilltop is to contemplate the stark charm of the Australian bush: vast grassy fields, swaths of eucalyptus forest and Instagram-worthy sunsets. This outpost is Australia’s national capital — not, as is commonly thought, the glitzier city of Sydney, three hours’ drive north. In Canberra, there are no beaches or iconic opera houses, and European chic is best sought an hour’s flight away in Melbourne. But what the “bush capital” lacks in big-city tousle, it makes up for in big-sky beauty, breezy civic pride and a decidedly hipster underbelly. Set on an artificial lake and spread across a valley between mountain ranges, Canberra is the Brasilia of Australia, designed by the American architects Walter Burley Griffin and Marion Mahony Griffin, who won a competition in 1911 to create the country’s political heart because Sydney and Melbourne couldn’t stop bickering about their own fabulousness. A year after the city’s centennial celebrations and with a steady influx of artists and gastronomes, Canberra is best appreciated with deep intakes of mountain air and an ear tuned to the calls of sulphur-crested cockatoos and crimson rosellas.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/travel/08-hours-top/08-hours-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 603, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/08/travel/08-hours-top/08-hours-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 603}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/travel/08-hours-top/08-hours-top-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1019, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/travel/08-hours-top/08-hours-top-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2038, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/travel/08-hours-top/08-hours-top-thumbS