k neighborhood, showcases work from a range of talent in a tiny, homelike storefront.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/05/ouli-la-design-store-echo-park/', 'snippet': 'Ouli, a new showroom and store in the rapidly changing Echo Park neighborhood, showcases work from a range of talent in a tiny, homelike storefront.', 'lead_paragraph': "One gets the feeling that Scott Barry and Brooke Intrachat would not be at all upset if you visited their new L.A. store Ouli simply to collapse into the buttery silver leather beanbag pouf (their design) and page through the adjacent copy of The Gentlewoman. In fact, with its exposed wood ceiling and feathery floral arrangements, Ouli is designed to feel more like a cozy, well-appointed living room than a gallery. “People come in and say, ‘what is this, a meditation center?'” says Barry.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/t-magazine/05ouli-walker/05ouli-walker-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/05/t-magazine/05ouli-walker/05ouli-walker-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/t-magazine/05ouli-walker/05ouli-walker-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/t-magazine/05ouli-walker/05ouli-walker-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/t-magazine/05ouli-walker/05ouli-walker-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width