r all things cheap, he’s been known to do a little pickin’ on the guitar, an instrument he was inspired to adopt as a teenager, predictably enough, by the great Jimi Hendrix. But the Miser was much less interested than his peers in learning Hendrix’s soulful solos by rote and much more taken with how he made music out of sonic “mistakes” — feedback, static, effects — and a general irreverence toward proper technique.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dither, a Guitar Quartet, to Play at the Noguchi Museum', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dither, a Guitar Quartet, to Play at the Noguchi Museum', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Noguchi Museum', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'StoryCorps', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Academy of Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-05T16:50:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.c. Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2557e1d5-0dc1-58cb-a289-f1c48b9e71a2', 'word_count': 437, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2557e1d5-0dc1-58cb-a289-f1c48b9e71a2'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama said he makes “no apologies” for seeking the release of Sgt. Bowe Bergdahl in a prisoner swap with the Taliban and defended the exchange, which has dogged him on his European trip.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/europe/100000002922235/obama-on-gi-release-at-group-of-seven.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama said he makes “no apologies” for seeking the release of Sgt. Bowe