es perfectly cooked, with silken flesh.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometimes I take the “What if?” approach to cooking and have had more successes than errors. A few weeks ago I decided to roast some stunningly fresh ocean perch whole. But what if, instead of my usual hot-roasting method, I wrapped the fish tightly in parchment and put it in a slow oven? I was risking $18 worth of fish and the prospect of takeout for dinner. I guessed that the fish, about two pounds, might need an hour and reasoned that succulence might define the end result.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11PAIR1/11PAIR1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11PAIR1/11PAIR1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11PAIR1/11PAIR1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11PAIR1/11PAIR1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1438, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11PAIR1/11PAIR1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11PAIR1/11PAIR1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11PAIR1/11PAIR1-thumbLar