 '_id': 'nyt://interactive/7e4b15a1-a0f1-5a74-b7f1-1f71927c028a', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/7e4b15a1-a0f1-5a74-b7f1-1f71927c028a'}, {'abstract': 'Portugal is setting its own course, avoiding global trends in favor of intriguing local vines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/11/dining/tasting-portuguese-white-wines.html', 'snippet': 'Portugal is setting its own course, avoiding global trends in favor of intriguing local vines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Of all the historical wine-producing countries, Portugal is the most overlooked.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11WINE/11WINE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 872, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11WINE/11WINE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 872}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11WINE/11WINE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 705, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11WINE/11WINE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1410, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11WINE/11WINE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11WINE/11WINE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/dining/11WINE/11WINE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'heig