ign costumes for Bjork’s opera — has an art show at Ruttkowski;68 in Cologne.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/05/henrik-vibskov-designs-for-bjork-and-has-art-show-at-ruttkowski-68/', 'snippet': 'The Danish multihyphenate — soon to design costumes for Bjork’s opera — has an art show at Ruttkowski;68 in Cologne.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the Paris men’s collections just a few weeks away, the Danish fashion designer Henrik Vibskov is busy at work. But it’s not just clothing that’s on his mind. When he spoke to T, he was busy putting the finishing touches on “Vibskovski;72 II,” his new solo exhibition at the Cologne art space Ruttkowski;68. He’d also submitted the first proposals for a collaboration with his fellow Nordic multihyphenate Björk, a supersize restaging of her album “Medúlla.” And then there’s the fragrance he’s developing, the upcoming art exhibitions in Moscow and Seoul, a set design for this month’s Roskilde Festival and a handful or so of other projects in progress listed on the pink sticky notes on his computer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/t-magazine/05vibskov-corcoran/05vibskov-corcoran-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/05/t-magazine/05vibskov-corcoran/05vibskov-corcoran-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/t-magazine/05vibskov-corcoran/05vibskov-corcoran-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/05/t-magazine/05vibskov-corcoran/05vibskov-corcoran-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 