014/06/06/arts/design/the-pre-raphaelite-legacy-at-the-met-is-a-journey-back.html', 'snippet': '“The Pre-Raphaelite Legacy,” at the Metropolitan Museum of Art, is a modest introduction to one of 19th-century Britain’s most interesting backward-looking groups.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As in politics, so in art: Some movements want to hasten us into the future, some want to turn back the clocks to a supposedly better time. “The Pre-Raphaelite Legacy: British Art and Design,” a small exhibition at the Metropolitan Museum of Art, is a modest introduction to one of the 19th century’s most interesting backward-looking groups.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/06JPPRERAPHAELITE1/JPPRERAPHAELITE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/06JPPRERAPHAELITE1/JPPRERAPHAELITE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 699}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/06JPPRERAPHAELITE1/JPPRERAPHAELITE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 879, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/06JPPRERAPHAELITE1/JPPRERAPHAELITE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1758, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/06JPPRERAPHAELITE1/JPPRERAPHAELITE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/06JPPRERAPHAELITE1/JPPRERAPHAELITE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 7