https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/06/world/middleeast/samarra-strike-sunni-militants-storm-central-iraqi-city.html', 'snippet': 'The offensive provided the latest evidence of the militants’ strength in Iraq, six months after hard-line Islamist fighters seized the western city of Falluja.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD — Hundreds of Sunni militants stormed the central Iraqi city of Samarra early Thursday, taking control of neighborhoods and government buildings in a siege that provoked a panicked government counteroffensive to prevent the loss of the town. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Brazen Strike, Sunni Militants Storm Central Iraqi City', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Brazen Strike, Sunni Militants Storm Central Iraqi City', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fahim, Kareem', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Samarra (Iraq)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State of Iraq and Syria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Strikes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-05T23:46:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kareem Fahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kareem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4a6ab57-8d6d-55fe-85a9-c918e32e2f5e', 'word_count': 535, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4a6ab57-8d6d-55fe-85a9-c918e32e2f5e'}, {'abstract': 'The E.P.A.’s proposed rules on carbon should start a chain reaction that leads to steps to limit climate change around the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/06/opinion/krugman-the-climate-domino.html', 'snippet': 'The E.P.A.’s proposed rules on carbon should start a chain reaction that leads to steps to limit climate change around the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Maybe it’s me, but the predictable right-wing cries of outrage over the Environmental Protection Agency’s proposed rules on carbon seem oddly muted and unfocused. I mean, these are the people who managed to create national outrage over nonexistent death panels. Now the Obama administration is doing something that really will impose at least some pain on some people. Where are the eye-catching fake horror stories?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/12/opinion/krugman-circular/krugman-circular-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 591, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/12/opinion/krugman-circular/krugman-circular-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 591}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/12/opinion/krugman-circular/krugman-circular-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1008, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/12/opinion/krugman-circular/krugman-circular-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1852, 'width': 1881, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/12/opinion/krugman-circular/krugman-circular-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy'