al battle leading to the reversal of California’s ban on same-sex marriage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/06/movies/the-case-against-8-on-fighting-a-same-sex-marriage-ban.html', 'snippet': 'The documentary “The Case Against 8” portrays the harrowing legal battle leading to the reversal of California’s ban on same-sex marriage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Opening in theaters before airing on HBO on June 23, “The Case Against 8” follows the legal challenge to Proposition 8, the 2008 referendum that banned same-sex marriage in California. Because the Supreme Court effectively nullified the ban last year — the decision said the initiative’s supporters lacked the standing to appeal a federal ruling striking it down — this documentary from Ben Cotner and Ryan White is less a work of immediacy than of backstage intrigue.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/CASEAGAINST/CASEAGAINST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/CASEAGAINST/CASEAGAINST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/CASEAGAINST/CASEAGAINST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/CASEAGAINST/CASEAGAINST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1300, 'width': 1932, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/arts/CASEAGAINST/CASEAGAINST-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 