l Operations forces, prompting concern that brain injuries and stress have not been properly treated. Susan Ullman’s husband, Sgt. First Class Michael B. Lube, committed suicide last summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After his fourth combat tour, to Afghanistan in 2011, Sgt. First Class Michael B. Lube, a proud member of the Army Special Forces, came home alienated and angry. Once a rock-solid sergeant and devoted husband, he became sullen, took to drinking, got in trouble with his commanders and started beating his wife.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'War’s Elite Tough Guys, Hesitant to Seek Healing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'War’s Elite Tough Guys, Hesitant to Seek Healing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shanker, Thom', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oppel, Richard A Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traumatic Brain Injury', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Special Operations Command', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Depression (Mental)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Navy Seals', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-06T02:26:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thom Shanker and Richard A. Oppel Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thom', 'm