b growth, things don’t feel so great.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We did it, America! Six and a half years after the Great Recession began, and five years after it ended, we have now regained all the jobs lost during the downturn. Huzzah!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Good News on Jobs. Why Aren’t We Happier?', 'kicker': 'Recovery in Need of a Recovery', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-06T13:24:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Irwin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Irwin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/076bc050-4cef-52b1-8940-1459aff7e64a', 'word_count': 687, 'uri': 'nyt://article/076bc050-4cef-52b1-8940-1459aff7e64a'}, {'abstract': 'An air-conditioning failure on Thursday led to sweltering conditions in San Antonio’s arena in Game 1 of the finals, and the Heat’s LeBron James watched the final minutes with leg cramps.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/07/sports/basketball/hot-arena-plays-role-for-heat-and-spurs-in-game-1-of-nba-finals.html', 'snippet': 'An air-conditioning failure on Thursday led to sweltering conditions in San Antonio’s arena in Game 1 of the finals, and the Heat’s LeBron James watched the final minutes with leg cramps.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN ANTONIO — As the temperature began to c