orked for JPMorgan Chase, Merrill Lynch and Credit Suisse First Boston, is one of four outside experts whom Pope Francis has appointed to oversee the Financial Information Authority at the Vatican.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/06/06/former-investment-banker-joins-vatican-financial-watchdog/', 'snippet': 'Marc Odendall, who has worked for JPMorgan Chase, Merrill Lynch and Credit Suisse First Boston, is one of four outside experts whom Pope Francis has appointed to oversee the Financial Information Authority at the Vatican.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Vatican has turned to a European banker to help oversee its financial watchdog.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/business/dealbook/dbpix-pope/dbpix-pope-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/06/business/dealbook/dbpix-pope/dbpix-pope-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/business/dealbook/dbpix-pope/dbpix-pope-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/business/dealbook/dbpix-pope/dbpix-pope-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/06/business/dealbook/dbpix-pope/dbpix-pope-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/06/business/dealbook/dbpix-pope/dbpix-pope-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh