sed on the negative.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/07/opinion/egypts-election-a-view-from-cairo.html', 'snippet': 'An Egyptian spokesman objects that coverage of the presidential election focused on the negative.', 'lead_paragraph': ' ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Egypt’s Election: A View From Cairo', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Egypt’s Election: A View From Cairo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-06T16:20:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a7afda0-dfee-53bc-a090-e02973156a21', 'word_count': 220, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a7afda0-dfee-53bc-a090-e02973156a21'}, {'abstract': 'An app called Tunnel Vision turns the subway map into a fount of information about both New York and the subway system itself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/08/nyregion/for-another-kind-of-platform.html', 'snippet': 'An app called Tunnel Vision turns the subway map into a fount of information about both New York and the subway system itself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Metropolitan Transportation Authority is expanding wireless coverage in stations across New York, but for now there’s still a good chance of getting caught on a platform with nothing new to read or see on your phone. If you find that possibility horrifying, you might consider downloading Tunnel Vision, an app that turns the subway map into a fount of information about both New York and the subway system itself.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u