V Crosstrek Hybrid will not turn in impressive fuel-economy numbers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Subaru and Prius owners are fiercely loyal to their rides. Subie drivers (who often dwell in polar vortex regions) pledge their allegiance to the Symmetrical All-Wheel Drive flag. The evangelical hybrid camp is more obsessed with fuel economy than getting places quickly. Conversely, it’s unwise to off-road a Prius, and the only way to guarantee lofty m.p.g.s in a Subaru is coasting from a mountain summit.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video: The Subaru XV Crosstrek Hybrid Won’t Save Much Green', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Subaru', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-06T16:42:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Voelk', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Voelk', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/637bd2b2-e011-58e5-ac98-6659dad65a45', 'word_count': 524, 'uri': 'nyt://article/637bd2b2-e011-58e5-ac98-6659dad65a45'}, {'abstract': 'Francesca’s Italian Bistro, which has relocated from its former strip-mall quarters to the quaint center of Coventry, presents a curious amalgam of familiar dishes nicely executed and offbeat ones whose novelty at times exceeds their quality.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/08/nyregion/a-review-of-francescas-italian-bistro-in-coventry.html', 'snippet': 'Francesca’s Italian Bistro, which has relocated from its former strip-mall quarters to the quaint center of Coventry, presents a curious amalgam of familiar dishes nicely executed and offbeat ones whose novelty at times exceeds their quality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Francesca’s Italian Bistro, to the delight of its ardent fans, has relocated from its former strip-mall quarters to the quaint center of Coventry. The restaurant, while bigger, is still cozy: a dozen tables with a view into the kitchen, where gusts of flame kick up as Salvatore Urso deglazes a pan. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08DINECT2/08DINECT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08DINECT2/08DINECT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08DINECT2/08DINECT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08DINECT2/08DINECT2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08DINECT2/08DINECT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08DINECT2/08DINECT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08DINECT2/08DINECT2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_nam