ble Strawberry Cheesecake', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clark, Melissa', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheesecake', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Strawberries', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-06T20:19:37+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'Jenny Woodward', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jenny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Woodward', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/0d7071b8-362f-5123-9fff-74505fa00276', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/0d7071b8-362f-5123-9fff-74505fa00276'}, {'abstract': 'This dessert encourages the cream and strawberries to unite in juicy-creamy joy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/11/dining/a-strawberry-cheesecake-that-is-red-and-white-and-pink-all-over.html', 'snippet': 'This dessert encourages the cream and strawberries to unite in juicy-creamy joy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Picture a strawberry cheesecake: white and creamy cake on the bottom, bright red berries on top. Maybe the berries are fresh and ripe and leak a little of their tart juice onto the dense cake below. More likely, the berries are sealed in shiny, syrupy goop. Either way, you get a separation of strawberries and cream, with the two playing off each other in juicy-creamy succession.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Strawberry Cheesecake That Is Red and White and Pink All Over', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Red and White and Pink All Over', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'na