o Ronaldo, Neymar da Silva Santos Jr. and Lionel Messi.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every four years, people around the world grab their noisemakers, don their team jerseys and gather in stadiums, living rooms and local bars to watch the World Cup. How can such an expansive and consuming event be covered in a 60-page magazine issue? And then how do you boil that into a single cover image?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/magazine/08cover-ronaldo/08cover-ronaldo-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/08/magazine/08cover-ronaldo/08cover-ronaldo-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/magazine/08cover-ronaldo/08cover-ronaldo-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/magazine/08cover-ronaldo/08cover-ronaldo-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 730, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/08/magazine/08cover-ronaldo/08cover-ronaldo-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 730}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/magazine/08cover-ronaldo/08cover-ronaldo-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 842, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/magazine/08cover-ronaldo/08cover-ronaldo-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1683, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_n