 reach old age.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/07/us/buying-upstate-new-york-land-va-closes-chapter-in-building-cemeteries.html', 'snippet': 'The department anticipates it will have enough burial space until 2050, when 2.6 million veterans of Iraq and Afghanistan begin to reach old age.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As the Allies gathered in France on Friday to honor the Americans who stormed the beaches of Normandy 70 years ago, a final resting place for World War II veterans had just been carved out of fields of grasses and clover in upstate New York.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/us/CEMETERY/CEMETERY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/07/us/CEMETERY/CEMETERY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/us/CEMETERY/CEMETERY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/us/CEMETERY/CEMETERY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/us/CEMETERY/CEMETERY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/07/us/CEMETERY/CEMETERY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/us/CEMETERY/CEMETERY-thu