s in a group that recruited Mark Messier and won city approval for a plan to redevelop the Kingsbridge Armory with nine rinks have sued one another.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/07/nyregion/plans-for-huge-ice-center-in-bronx-stall.html', 'snippet': 'Principals in a group that recruited Mark Messier and won city approval for a plan to redevelop the Kingsbridge Armory with nine rinks have sued one another.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An ambitious effort to convert the Kingsbridge Armory into a national ice sports center has stalled in recent weeks amid a bitter feud and two lawsuits over future profits and control of the development group behind the project.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/07KINGSBRIDGE1web/07KINGSBRIDGE1web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/07KINGSBRIDGE1web/07KINGSBRIDGE1web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/07KINGSBRIDGE1web/07KINGSBRIDGE1web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/07KINGSBRIDGE1web/07KINGSBRIDGE1web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/07KINGSBRIDGE1web/07KINGSBRIDGE1web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/