n, Jordan’s ambassador to the United Nations, was nominated to replace Navi Pillay as high commissioner for human rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/07/world/un-chief-picks-jordanian-prince-zeid-raad-zeid-al-hussein-for-rights-post.html', 'snippet': 'Prince Zeid Ra’ad Zeid al-Hussein, Jordan’s ambassador to the United Nations, was nominated to replace Navi Pillay as high commissioner for human rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — United Nations Secretary General Ban Ki-moon on Friday nominated a veteran diplomat and relative of Jordan’s royal family to be the agency’s next high commissioner for human rights.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Chief Picks Jordanian Prince for Rights Post', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Chief Picks Jordanian Prince for Rights Post', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cumming-Bruce, Nick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "Zeid Ra'ad Zeid Al Hussein", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ban Ki-moon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-07T02:03:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Cumming-Bruce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5486bf4a-47d2-5c1c-8b11-ee49c3d2dc60', 'word_count': 281, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5486bf4a-47d2-5c1c-8b11-ee49c3d2dc60'}, {'abstract': 'At least 10 states have already met President Obama’s goal of a 30 percent reduction in power plant emissions by 2030, without the economic damage that critics have warned would occur.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/07/science/in-some-states-emissions-cuts-defy-skeptics.html', 'snippet': 'At least 10 states have already met President Obama’s goal of a 30 percent reduction in power plant emissions by 2030, without the economic damage that critics have warned would occur.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cries of protest have been fierce, warning that President Obama’s plan to cut greenhouse gases from power plants will bring soaring electricity bills and even plunge the nation into blackouts. By the time the administration is finished, one prominent critic said, “millions of Americans will be freezing in the dark.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/us/JP-STATES/JP-STATES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/07/us/JP-STATES/JP-STATES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/us/JP-STATES/JP-STATES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/us/JP-STATES/JP-STATES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/us/JP-STATES/JP-STATES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/07/us/JP-STATES/JP-STATES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': N