n’t Be Charged', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trees and Shrubs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pogash, Carol', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Postal Service and Post Offices', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pulido, Ernesto', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fish and Wildlife Service', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Postal Service (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Birds', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oakland (Calif)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-07T02:47:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Pogash', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogash', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9fa3c7b-f600-5b7d-89ca-6cea6b7da159', 'word_count': 95, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9fa3c7b-f600-5b7d-89ca-6cea6b7da159'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. DeCrow led the National Organization for Women during the 1970s, fighting for the Equal Rights Amendment and Title IX.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/07/nyregion/karen-decrow-former-president-of-now-dies-at-76.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. DeCrow led the National Organization for Women during the 1970s, fighting for the Equal Rights Amendment and Title IX.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Karen DeCrow, who was president of the National Organization for Women during the 1970s, a turbulent period in which she helped lead campaigns for passage of the Equal Rights Amendment and against sex discrimination in education and sports, died on Friday at her home in Jamesville, N.Y., a suburb of Syracuse. She was 76.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/De-Crow-obit/De-Crow-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 805, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/De-Crow-obit/De-Crow-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 805}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/De-Crow-obit/De-Crow-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 764, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/De-Crow-obit/De-Crow-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1527, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/De-Crow-obit/De-Crow-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/De-Crow-obit/De-Crow-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/nyregion/De-Crow-obit/De-Crow-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Karen DeCrow Dies at 76; Feminist Lawyer and Author Led NOW', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Karen DeCrow, Former President of NOW, Dies at 76', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DeCrow, Karen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yardle