n the states. Gov. Nikki R. Haley of South Carolina signed that state’s bill last week, and Gov. Mary Fallin of Oklahoma signed a bill on Thursday that would require educators in the state to set new standards to replace the Common Core. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Two States Repeal Education Standards', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Education', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two States Repeal Education Standards', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oklahoma', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-07T03:04:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Motoko Rich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Motoko', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/7cc44368-db2d-56e4-a01d-43b29b5b5609', 'word_count': 131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7cc44368-db2d-56e4-a01d-43b29b5b5609'}, {'abstract': 'The broken air-conditioning system in Game 1 of the N.B.A. finals was highly unusual, but it did not compare to the Fog Game during the Stanley Cup finals on May 20, 1975.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/07/sports/hockey/the-sabres-and-flyers-played-a-low-visibility-game-in-1975.html', 'snippet': 'The broken air-conditioning system in Game 1 of the N.B.A. finals was highly unusual, but it did not compare to the Fog Game during the Stanley Cup finals on May 20, 1975.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The broken air-conditioning system at San Antonio’s AT&T Center on Thursday in Game 1 of the N.B.A. finals was highly unusual, but those saunalike conditions did not compare to the Fog Game during the Stanley Cup finals on May 20, 1975, between the Buffalo Sabres and the Philadelphia Flyers.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/sports/CITY-SABRES/CITY-SABRES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/07/sports/CITY-SABRES/CITY-SABRES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 436}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/sports/CITY-SABRES/CITY-SABRES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/sports/CITY-SABRES/CITY-SABRES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1489, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/sports/CITY-SABRES/CITY-SABRES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/07/sports/CITY-SABRES/CITY-SABRES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/07/sports/CITY-SABRES/CITY-SABRES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Neither Player Nor Bat Was Ready for the Fog', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 