nday is hardly ever a day off for Mr. Telsey, a casting director, who is always fielding requests from producers and directors. But he’s become adept at carving out time for family, too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As one of more than 800 Tony Award voters, the casting director Bernard Telsey gets invited to every new Broadway show that is eligible for an award, so he’s a regular at Sunday matinees — most of them a quick walk from his Hell’s Kitchen brownstone. Indeed, Sunday is hardly ever a day off: He is always fielding requests from producers and directors obsessing over their theater, television and film projects. But Mr. Telsey, 54, has become adept at carving out time for his wife, Anne Marino, an executive with Tommy Hilfiger; their sons Daniel Marino, 25, who lives in Brooklyn, and Felix Telsey, 14; and the family’s Maltese poodles, Wally and Louie.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08ROUTINE1/08ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 470, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08ROUTINE1/08ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 470}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08ROUTINE1/08ROUTINE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 802, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08ROUTINE1/08ROUTINE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1605, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/nyregion/08ROUTINE1/08ROUTINE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 7