talk of the town — among prisoners, among guards and between the two groups.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A View From Gitmo', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A View From Gitmo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bergdahl, Bowe R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guantanamo Bay Naval Base (Cuba)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Detainees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hunger Strikes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisoners of War', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-07T18:30:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ramzi Kassem', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ramzi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kassem', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c04c6ff-b278-5b19-8558-db6961d98972', 'word_count': 914, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c04c6ff-b278-5b19-8558-db6961d98972'}, {'abstract': 'Only Hillary Clinton can hold together the Democrats’ political coalition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/08/opinion/sunday/douthat-there-is-no-alternative.html', 'snippet': 'Only Hillary Clinton can hold together the Democrats’ political coalition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IF the excerpts currently circulating in the press are any indication, Hillary Clinton’s latest memoir will resemble pretty much every recent politic