d boys and girls in a makeshift detention center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/08/us/child-migrants-strain-makeshift-arizona-shelter.html', 'snippet': 'Immigration officials overwhelmed by a flood of women and children from Central America are housing hundreds of unaccompanied boys and girls in a makeshift detention center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHOENIX — Immigration officials overwhelmed by a flood of women and children from Central America who illegally crossed the border from Mexico are moving hundreds of unaccompanied boys and girls this weekend to a makeshift detention center in Nogales, Ariz.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Child Migrants Strain Makeshift Arizona Shelter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Child Migrants Strain Makeshift Arizona Shelter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nogales (Ariz)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Immigration and Customs Enforcement (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brewer, Jan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-07T19:16:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Belson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8324c8f2-f257-5d52-8cf4-421b09e71c0e', 'word_count': 521, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8324c8f2-f257-5d52-8cf4-421b09e71c0e'}, {'abstract': 'The prisoner swap that brought Sgt. Bowe Bergdahl home has drawn criticism and will be the main focus of the Sunday news shows.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/07/sunday-breakfast-menu-june-8/', 'snippet': 'The prisoner swap that brought Sgt. Bowe Bergdahl home has drawn criticism and will be the main focus of the Sunday news shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Taliban released a video on Wednesday of their handover of Sgt. Bowe Bergdahl to American troops, and it quickly went viral. The exchange — five Taliban prisoners were released from Guantánamo Bay in exchange for Sergeant Bergdahl — drew criticism from some lawmakers, who disagreed with President Obama’s decision. The story was made murkier when soldiers who served with Sergeant Bergdahl called him a deserter and some blamed him for the deaths of six to eight soldiers who were killed in a search mission for him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunday Breakfast Menu, June 8', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-07T19:17:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elena Schneider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schneider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/efe2cab5-b00e-5789-b22d-2eff5dbaff1f', 'word_count': 413, 'uri': 'nyt://article/efe2cab5-b00e-5789-b22d-2eff5dbaff1f'}, {'abstract': 'While the Astros’ recent top draft picks are still in the minor leagues, several long-term answers are now everyday players in Houston.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/08/sports/baseball/the-overhaul-of-the-astros-is-starting-to-bear-fruit.html', 'snippet': 'While the Astros’ recent top draft picks are still in the minor leagues, several long-term answers are now everyday players in Houston.',