d7f7558-25a2-51e7-8e50-096c738cd990', 'word_count': 480, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd7f7558-25a2-51e7-8e50-096c738cd990'}, {'abstract': 'Tonalist won the 146th running of the Belmont Stakes on Saturday, denying California Chrome his shot at becoming the first Triple Crown winner since Affirmed in 1978.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/08/sports/tonalist-wins-belmont-stakes-denying-triple-crown-for-california-chrome.html', 'snippet': 'Tonalist won the 146th running of the Belmont Stakes on Saturday, denying California Chrome his shot at becoming the first Triple Crown winner since Affirmed in 1978.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The gates popped open Saturday, and 11 horses charged past the grandstand for a mile-and-a-half marathon nicknamed, fittingly, the Test of the Champion. All eyes were on California Chrome, in pursuit of the first Triple Crown since 1978. There appeared to be little to worry about as jockey Victor Espinoza spurted him along the rail and glided him into the first turn almost easier than he had in his six previous races, all victories.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/sports/WEB-belmont2/WEB-belmont2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/08/sports/WEB-belmont2/WEB-belmont2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/sports/WEB-belmont2/WEB-belmont2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/08/sports/WEB-belmont2/WEB-belmont2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'cr