 leg, a broken femur, a broken nose and several broken ribs, his publicist Lewis Kay said on Sunday. He was hurt when a tractor-trailer slammed into the back of the luxury van he was riding in as he left a comedy show in Delaware around 1 a.m. on Saturday. Mr. Morgan is expected to remain in the hospital for several weeks, Mr. Kay said.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/arts1/arts1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 795, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/arts1/arts1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 795}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/arts1/arts1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 773, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/arts1/arts1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1545, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/arts1/arts1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/arts1/arts1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/arts1/arts1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tracy Morgan, Still Critical, Is ‘More Responsive’', 'kicker': 'Arts, Briefly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tracy Morgan,