 two weekends were created and performed by people other than Ms. Dorvillier. And on Friday, when she debuted her own work, also called “Diary of an Image,” she gave over the first part of the piece to stationary silhouettes of other dancers. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/diary/diary-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 742, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/diary/diary-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 742}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/diary/diary-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 828, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/diary/diary-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1656, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/diary/diary-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/diary/diary-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/diary/diary-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Work Moves, Even if Some of the Figures Do Not', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Work Moves, Even if Some of the Figures Do Not', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name