n orchestral player, Leonard Bernstein appointed him as concertmaster of the New York Philharmonic in 1966.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/09/arts/music/david-nadien-philharmonic-concertmaster-is-dead-at-88.html', 'snippet': 'Although Mr. Nadien’s background was as a studio musician and not an orchestral player, Leonard Bernstein appointed him as concertmaster of the New York Philharmonic in 1966.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Nadien, a violinist whose appointment as concertmaster of the New York Philharmonic raised eyebrows because of his thriving career as a studio musician, died on May 28 in Manhattan. He was 88.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/nadien-obit/nadien-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/nadien-obit/nadien-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/nadien-obit/nadien-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/nadien-obit/nadien-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1415, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/nadien-obit/nadien-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/09/arts/nadien-obit/nadien-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarg