ussing the possibility with his brother, Dave Davies. “I met Dave only last week to talk about getting back together again,” he told the paper. Although the two generally composed separately during the Kinks’ heyday, Ray Davies said that he would like to write some new songs with his brother.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Talk of a Kinks Reunion Heats Up', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Talk of a Kinks Reunion Seems to Be Heating Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davies, Dave', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davies, Ray', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kinks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sunday Times (British Newspaper)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-09T16:53:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddeadfbb-9589-5ccd-9d3d-bf8eeb5d60a8', 'word_count': 320, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddeadfbb-9589-5ccd-9d3d-bf8eeb5d60a8'}, {'abstract': 'A grainy video of a crowd of men assaulting a woman that circulated on the Internet presented the new Egyptian president with an immediate test on assault and harassment of women.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/10/world/middleeast/video-of-mass-sexual-assault-taints-egypt-inauguration.html', 'snippet': 'A grainy video of a crowd of men assaulting a woman that circulated on the Internet prese