ar event at the Texas Motor Speedway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/10/automobiles/monday-motorsports-ricciardo-breaks-through-in-formula-one.html', 'snippet': 'Daniel Ricciardo won the Canadian Grand Prix for his first Formula One victory; Ed Carpenter held off Will Power to take the IndyCar event at the Texas Motor Speedway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Daniel Ricciardo scored his first career victory in Formula One, passing Nico Rosberg with three laps to go in the Canadian Grand Prix in Montreal on Sunday. Ricciardo’s win was also the first this season for the Red Bull Infiniti team. His teammate, Sebastian Vettel, the defending series champion, collected third place behind Rosberg.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/automobiles/10MOTORSPORTS-image/10MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/10/automobiles/10MOTORSPORTS-image/10MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/automobiles/10MOTORSPORTS-image/10MOTORSPORTS-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/automobiles/10MOTORSPORTS-image/10MOTORSPORTS-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/automobiles/10MOTORSPORTS-image/10MOTORSPORTS-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'im