https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/09/leaving-searchlight-behind-reid-is-moving-to-las-vegas/', 'snippet': 'Senator Harry Reid sold his home in Searchlight to Nevada Mining and Milling and is moving to Las Vegas to be closer to his children and grandchildren.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For decades, Searchlight, Nev., has been synonymous with Senator Harry Reid, the Democratic leader whose birthplace has fueled scores of elegiac floor speeches, campaign events\xa0and even a book, “The Camp That Didn’t Fail,” a history of the tiny mining town where he was raised.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leaving Searchlight Behind, Reid Is Moving to Las Vegas', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reid, Harry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Las Vegas (Nev)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-09T21:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Steinhauer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Steinhauer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2dc5726a-ff18-5923-97c4-ceaed109986c', 'word_count': 301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2dc5726a-ff18-5923-97c4-ceaed109986c'}, {'abstract': 'In Portland, Ore., the restaurant Nostrana hosts its fourth annual Negroni Social, complete with 12 recipes concocted by leading lady chefs like Nancy Silverton, recent winner of the most prestigious James Beard award.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/09/negroni-week-rooster-bar-portland-oregon-nancy-silverton/', 'snippet': 'In Portland, Ore., the restaurant Nostrana hosts its fourth annual Negroni Social, complete with 12 recipes concocted by leading lady chefs like Nancy Silverton, recent winner of the most prestigious James Beard award.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the fourth annual Negroni Social at the Rooster Bar at the rustic Italian restaurant Nostrana in Portland, Ore., the chef Cathy Whims recruited 11 of her female chef friends to contribute riffs on the quintessentially Italian cocktail. “I don’t know a chef that doesn’t adore a perfect Negroni,” explained Whims about her decision to recruit talent from the kitchen side of the house to dream up cocktail recipes. “As an aperitivo, the Negroni opens up your palate, kick-starts your digestion and prepares you for the meal ahead of you. It actually makes you think about all the flavors your are experiencing, and I think that’s part of why it lends itself to being so relevant to chefs developing their own versions.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cocktail Culture | One Negroni for Every Month of the Year', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocktails', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hamilton, Gabrielle', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Silverton, Nancy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portland (Ore)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-09T21:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Rowan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rowan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organi