st weekend, a particularly busy day in sports news made producing the section a bit of a nightmare.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2014/06/09/in-sports-its-a-marathon-with-sprints-in-between/', 'snippet': 'This past weekend, a particularly busy day in sports news made producing the section a bit of a nightmare.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Benjamin Hoffman has designed Times sports pages since 2004. Here, he talks about the unique challenge of producing the Sunday section, using this past weekend’s as an example.Deadlines were blown, tempers flared and compromises were made.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/blogs/sportspg1/sportspg1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 281, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/09/blogs/sportspg1/sportspg1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 281}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/blogs/sportspg1/sportspg1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/blogs/sportspg1/sportspg1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 959, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/blogs/sportspg1/sportspg1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/09/blogs/sportspg1/sportspg1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/blogs/sportspg1/sport