', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kenneth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1821d388-ae3e-5beb-a618-6f4a695db50e', 'word_count': 909, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1821d388-ae3e-5beb-a618-6f4a695db50e'}, {'abstract': 'New York’s music-loving finest descended upon Randall’s Island for three days of shows and nonstop people-watching opportunities.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/09/the-governors-ball-music-festival-2014-street-style-photos/', 'snippet': 'New York’s music-loving finest descended upon Randall’s Island for three days of shows and nonstop people-watching opportunities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scenes from the New York Governors Ball photo diary of Aurelie Pellissier.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Governors Ball Music Festival 2014', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors Ball Music Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'OutKast', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sleigh Bells (Music Group)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Strokes, The (Music Group)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vampire Weekend (Music Group)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-09T22:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aurelie Pellissier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aurelie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pellissier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62b50f3f-cb8c-5c93-8a1a-12ae3b04d8eb', 'word_count': 176, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62b50f3f-cb8c-5c93-8a1a-12ae3b04d8eb'}, {'abstract': 'Jessie Mueller came to New York with fears that she would never get desirable roles again, but she made a splash in “Beautiful: The Carole King Musical” and won a Tony.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/10/theater/theaterspecial/jessie-mueller-as-herself-after-a-starry-night.html', 'snippet': 'Jessie Mueller came to New York with fears that she would never get desirable roles again, but she made a splash in “Beautiful: The Carole King Musical” and won a Tony.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jessie Mueller never expected to outgrow the Chicago theater scene. She grew up in a family of actors in Evanston, Ill., and loved nothing more than watching her parents dress up for local awards banquets when they were nominees. She went on to win acclaim there for roles in “Carousel” and “She Loves Me,” once even borrowing a dress for a prize ceremony that her mother had worn years earlier.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/arts/subtonyfolo/subtonyfolo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/10/arts/subtonyfolo/subtonyfolo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/arts/subtonyfolo/subtonyfolo-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 632, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/arts/subtonyfolo/subtonyfolo-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1264, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': 