as planned Tuesday against Seattle’s Hisashi Iwakuma, because Manager Joe Girardi is pushing his entire rotation back.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KANSAS CITY, Mo. — Masahiro Tanaka could not have known it when he boarded his flight to Seattle on Monday afternoon: His pitching matchup on Tuesday night with Hisashi Iwakuma, his former teammate with Tohoku Rakuten in Japan’s Pacific League, was not going to happen.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tanaka’s Matchup Against Ex-Teammate Falls Through', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tanaka’s Matchup Against Ex-Teammate Falls Through', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kansas City Royals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Iwakuma, Hisashi', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tanaka, Masahiro', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Girardi, Joe', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ellsbury, Jacoby', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-10T03:05:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pat Borzi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pat', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borzi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/802dc892-5ed6-5eb0-a045-178da07acff4', 'word_count': 856, 'uri': 'nyt://article/802dc892-5ed6-5eb0-a045-178da07acff4'}, {'abstract': 'France has momentum coming off its drubbing of Jamaica in a warmup match, a nice confidence boost after the loss of Franck Ribéry to injury.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/10/sports/soccer/france-find