e, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d7d5f5e8-5071-562c-85b7-2621ae1744e9', 'word_count': 423, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d7d5f5e8-5071-562c-85b7-2621ae1744e9'}, {'abstract': 'Although Kelly is carrying their daughter, we won’t know until she arrives who the biological mother is. For now, it’s father’s baby; mother’s maybe.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/10/whos-your-mommy-we-dont-know-yet/', 'snippet': 'Although Kelly is carrying their daughter, we won’t know until she arrives who the biological mother is. For now, it’s father’s baby; mother’s maybe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over a year ago, despite my many doubts, I agreed to become a sperm donor for my good friends, Tori and Kelly. Saying yes, it turns out, was the easy part. It took nearly a year of failed attempts before Kelly conceived. For the round of I.V.F. that finally worked, moreover, both of my friends decided to harvest eggs. The clinic then transferred the two best resulting embryos, one from each woman, to increase Kelly’s odds of conceiving. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/us/motherlode-3-babies/motherlode-3-babies-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 180, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/09/us/motherlode-3-babies/motherlode-3-babies-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 180}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/us/motherlode-3-babies/motherlode-3-babies-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 307, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/us/motherlode-3-babies/motherlode-3-babies-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 1080, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/us/motherlode-3-babies/motherlode-3-babies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/09/us/motherlode-3-babies/motherlode-3-babies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/09/us/motherlode-3-babies/motherlode-3-babies-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Who’s Your Mommy? We Don’t Know — Yet', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetics and Heredity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Infertility', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sperm', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-10T13:23:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Dodge', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dodge', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c836508-7368-52ce-847f-691ef02c4818', 'word_count': 871, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c836508-7368-52ce-847f-691ef02c4818'}, {'abstract': 'The selection of Reuven Rivlin, a veteran Likud Party politician, ends what was seen as an unseemly race for a largely ceremonial post.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/11/world/middleeast/israeli-parliament-elects-rivlin-as-new-president.html', 'snippet': 'The selection of Reuven Rivlin, a veteran Likud Party politician, ends what was seen as an unseemly race for a largely ceremonial post.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — The Israeli Parliament on Tuesday elected Reuven Rivlin, a veteran Likud Party politician and former minister and Parliament speaker, as the country’s next president, ending what many here described as the most unseemly race in Israel’s history for what is largely a ceremonial post.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/world/middleeast/11ISRAEL/11ISRAEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/10/world/middleeast/11ISRAEL/11ISRAEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/world/middleeast/11ISRAEL/11ISRAEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/world/middleeast/11ISRAEL/11ISRAEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1290, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/world/middleeast/11ISRAEL/11ISRAEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/10/world/middleeast/11ISRAEL/11ISRAEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheigh