ride offers erotic, evocative wedding wear for millennial brides.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/fashion/shopping-at-stone-fox-bride-wedding-dress-for-millennials.html', 'snippet': 'Stone Fox Bride offers erotic, evocative wedding wear for millennial brides.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN THE DECADE-PLUS since the psychologist Barry Schwartz published his oft-cited book “The Paradox of Choice: Why More is Less,” the options available to the American bride have increased beyond measure. She can legally marry another woman in many states. She can skip the whole wedding racket entirely, in protest or preoccupation or boredom, and suffer no social stigma whatsoever. Or — and this is a hedge I have observed among many urban millennials — she can sort of back up slowly, shruggingly, consciously down the aisle: save the blood-diamond money for a down payment on a Clinton Hill condominium; hire friends to do the organic catering; and buy her frock, perhaps in electric-blue, from Etsy or similar.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/fashion/12CRITICAL1/12zCRITICAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 510, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/12/fashion/12CRITICAL1/12zCRITICAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 510}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/fashion/12CRITICAL1/12zCRITICAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 871, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/fashion/12CRITICAL1/12zCRITICAL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1742, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype