 None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe4d30d4-7ba2-5c44-b47d-a451fe78cd60', 'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe4d30d4-7ba2-5c44-b47d-a451fe78cd60'}, {'abstract': 'There has been a shift in the mass fragrance market toward a higher sophistication in both aroma and packaging.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/fashion/mass-market-perfumes-developed-by-high-priced-noses.html', 'snippet': 'There has been a shift in the mass fragrance market toward a higher sophistication in both aroma and packaging.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perfume lovers can now buy a deeply scented bottle of a new eau de toilette, blended with natural oils of sandalwood and jasmine absolute sambac, both imported from India, formulated by the French-trained perfumer who has worked on scents from luxurious niche brands like Atelier Cologne, which last year introduced a pair of fragrances in sleek glass bottles infused with either gold or silver, retailing at $195.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/fashion/12zSKIN4/12zSKIN4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/12/fashion/12zSKIN4/12zSKIN4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/fashion/12zSKIN4/12zSKIN4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/fashion/12zSKIN4/12zSKIN4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy