 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/667acba4-18b0-56f8-b90a-2a4b63a7111d'}, {'abstract': 'As carriers across Europe face more competition, the airline also has to cope with the effect of a three-day strike in April.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/business/international/lufthansa-trims-profit-forecast.html', 'snippet': 'As carriers across Europe face more competition, the airline also has to cope with the effect of a three-day strike in April.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Lufthansa on Wednesday sharply reduced its profit forecasts for the next two years, citing slower than expected recovery in demand for its passenger and cargo services, as well as the fallout from widespread strikes earlier this year.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lufthansa Trims Profit Forecast for 2 Years', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lufthansa Trims Profit Forecast for 2 Years', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deutsche Lufthansa AG', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Frankfurt (Germany)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-11T09:33:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicola Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicola', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2de8487-7458-5209-a7b6-f58c26320fb1', 'word_count': 538, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2de8487-7458-5209-a7