ht to capitalize on the worldwide growth of tourism, countries in Eastern Europe began campaigns to attract more foreign travelers.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/11/1964-east-bloc-working-to-win-bigger-share-of-tourism/', 'snippet': 'As the Soviet bloc sought to capitalize on the worldwide growth of tourism, countries in Eastern Europe began campaigns to attract more foreign travelers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — All the Communist powers, apart from Albania and East Germany, are making a concerted drive to win a bigger share of the riches of the international tourist industry. Since the start of 1964 newspapers in Britain and Western Europe have been carrying a regular and impressive display of Communist tourist advertisements.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/blogs/11iht-retrospective-tourism/11iht-retrospective-tourism-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 968, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/11/blogs/11iht-retrospective-tourism/11iht-retrospective-tourism-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 968}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/blogs/11iht-retrospective-tourism/11iht-retrospective-tourism-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 635, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/blogs/11iht-retrospective-tourism/11iht-retrospective-tourism-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1269, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/11/blogs/11iht-retrospective-tourism/11iht-retrospective-tourism-thumbStan