'nyt://article/0ba10a5c-fb1e-5b8e-b9b4-20e58e30f306', 'word_count': 591, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0ba10a5c-fb1e-5b8e-b9b4-20e58e30f306'}, {'abstract': 'Jack Lew, the Treasury secretary, explains why — and how — he thinks the economy can grow more quickly.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/upshot/is-americas-economy-stuck-in-the-doldrums-the-case-for-optimism.html', 'snippet': 'Jack Lew, the Treasury secretary, explains why — and how — he thinks the economy can grow more quickly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the most important economic debates of our time is whether America’s economic machine is fundamentally broken. What should it tell us that growth has been considerably slower since 2000 than it was in the decades before? Or that in recent years the economy has felt healthy only during an unsustainable credit and housing bubble?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/upshot/SUB-12UP-LEW/SUB-12UP-LEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/12/upshot/SUB-12UP-LEW/SUB-12UP-LEW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/upshot/SUB-12UP-LEW/SUB-12UP-LEW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/upshot/SUB-12UP-LEW/SUB-12UP-LEW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/upshot/SUB-12UP-LEW/SUB-12UP-LEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop