ance in ages Tuesday night. He probably wasn’t intending to make an argument about maximizing the efficiency of the tax system in his appearance on the “Late Show With David Letterman,” but that’s what he ended up doing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dave Chappelle Makes the Case for High Marginal Tax Rates', 'kicker': 'Everyday Economics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chappelle, Dave', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Letterman, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-11T15:11:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Irwin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Irwin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/464d715c-3f12-50a2-8de0-f56e20e223da', 'word_count': 523, 'uri': 'nyt://article/464d715c-3f12-50a2-8de0-f56e20e223da'}, {'abstract': 'The action could also affect millions of vehicles already recalled from other manufacturers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/automobiles/toyota-recalls-2-3-million-vehicles-for-air-bag-problem.html', 'snippet': 'The action could also affect millions of vehicles already recalled from other manufacturers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a widening safety problem at one of the world’s largest auto suppliers, 2.3 million Toyota vehicles are being recalled worldwide because a defective air bag component made by Takata Corporation could injure passengers. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/