6b3-909ac53ad1cc'}, {'abstract': 'A former President of Ireland on why a new conference will give women who were sexually assaulted a chance to defend their dignity.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/11/bringing-women-to-the-table-to-address-sexual-violence/', 'snippet': 'A former President of Ireland on why a new conference will give women who were sexually assaulted a chance to defend their dignity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In war zones, rape is a weapon. We cannot claim to be serious about stopping war crimes if we do nothing to prevent and punish these heinous acts – and if women are not part of the solution every step of the way.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bringing Women to the Table to Address Sexual Violence', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-11T15:53:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Robinson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robinson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/270b110d-4b9b-5708-94bd-f0efcfe8ef4a', 'word_count': 800, 'uri': 'nyt://article/270b110d-4b9b-5708-94bd-f0efcfe8ef4a'}, {'abstract': 'Having unleashed the most destructive political impulses of his party, Eric Cantor finally fell victim to them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/opinion/in-gop-far-right-is-too-moderate.html', 'snippet': 'Having unleashed the most destructive political impulses of his party, Eric Cantor finally fell victim to them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The forces of political nihilism not only remain alive and well within the Republican Party, but they are on the rise. Witness the way they shook Washington on Tuesday by removing from power Eric Cantor, the House majority leader, who had been one of the most implacable opponents to the reform of immigration, health care and taxation. His crime (in addition to complacent campaigning)? He was occasionally obliged, as a leader, to take a few minimalist steps toward governing, like raising the debt ceiling and ending a ruinous shutdown.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In G.O.P., Far Right Is Too Moderate', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In G.O.P., Far Right Is Too Moderate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brat, David A', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cantor, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, House of Representatives', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-11T15:54:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/3fc5437c-706c-52e0-87c5-4ed9f0e17064', 'word_count': 633, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3fc5437c-706c-52e0-87c5-4ed9f0e17064'}, {'abstract': '“The Who and the What,” part of Lincoln Center Th