 2006 before he was given an administrative discharge, military officials said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/us/bowe-bergdahl-discharged-from-coast-guard-before-joining-army.html', 'snippet': 'Sgt. Bowe Bergdahl spent just short of a month in basic training with the United States Coast Guard in early 2006 before he was given an administrative discharge, military officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sgt. Bowe Bergdahl spent four weeks in basic training with the United States Coast Guard in early 2006 before he was given an administrative discharge, military officials said Wednesday. The disclosure raised new questions about whether Sergeant Bergdahl should have been allowed to enlist in the Army two years later, and whether he had to be given a waiver to join either because he had previously washed out of boot camp or because of concerns about his emotional fitness.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Before Army, P.O.W. Failed at Coast Guard Training', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Before Army, P.O.W. Failed at Coast Guard Training', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oppel, Richard A Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Coast Guard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmitt, Eric', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bergdahl, Bowe R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisoners of War', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-11T18:02:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byli