ed the first modern Renaissance fair in an effort “to bring history to life.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/arts/phyllis-patterson-who-revived-16th-century-dies-at-82.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Patterson, with her husband, Ron, created the first modern Renaissance fair in an effort “to bring history to life.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Phyllis Patterson, who brought 16th-century Europe to Southern California in the 1960s when she helped found the first contemporary Renaissance fair, died on May 18 in a hospital in San Rafael, Calif. She was 82 and lived in a log cabin nearby, in Novato.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/us/PATTERSON-obit/PATTERSON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/12/us/PATTERSON-obit/PATTERSON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 781}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/us/PATTERSON-obit/PATTERSON-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 787, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/us/PATTERSON-obit/PATTERSON-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1573, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/us/PATTERSON-obit/PATTERSON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/12/us/PATTERSON-obit/PATTERSON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'cap