 by nothing more than an ordinary padlock.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/us/security-of-sites-storing-small-radioactive-material-is-found-to-be-lacking.html', 'snippet': 'A report by the Government Accountability Office said that some “radiological sources” were secured by nothing more than an ordinary padlock.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Radioactive chunks of industrial metal that could be used in terrorist attacks are sometimes secured at sites around the country with no more than ordinary padlocks, according to congressional auditors. Also, auditors called ineffective the procedures for doing background checks of employers handling the materials.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Security of Sites Storing Small Radioactive Material Is Found to Be Lacking', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Security of Sites Storing Small Radioactive Material Is Found to Be Lacking', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Energy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nuclear Regulatory Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radiation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Government Accountability Office', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carper, Thomas R', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Casey, Robert P Jr', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate Committee on Homeland Security and Governmental Affairs', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-12T03:27:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstn