e world? Why?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The World Cup, which is held every four years, begins on Thursday in Brazil and will last until mid-July. Thirty-two countries are contending for the title of world champion. The last time around, Spain won — but who will win this year? And will you be watching?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/sports/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-LN/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/10/sports/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-LN/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/sports/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-LN/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/sports/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-LN/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1473, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/sports/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-LN/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/10/sports/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-LN/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/10/sports/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-LN/Y-JP-AMERICANS-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Will You Be Watching the Worl