https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/184-questions-to-write-or-talk-about/', 'snippet': 'A collection of 184 Student Opinion questions, from this school year, all still open to comment on our blog. Each asks students to read a short, high-interest nonfiction piece from The Times, then write in a response.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’ve posted a fresh Student Opinion question nearly every weekday for the last five academic years. Every June, just as we do with that year’s lesson plans, we round them all up and post them in one place. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '184 Questions to Write or Talk About', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-12T14:01:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8742fec7-a273-5412-bd7a-e558b48387f4', 'word_count': 1845, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8742fec7-a273-5412-bd7a-e558b48387f4'}, {'abstract': 'The feature, free for Amazon Prime subscribers, has thousands of songs but does not include most new releases or the Universal Music Group catalog.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/13/business/media/amazon-introduces-music-streaming-service.html', 'snippet': 'The feature, free for Amazon Prime subscribers, has thousands of songs but does not include most new releases or the Universal Music Group catalog.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amazon introduced a music streaming feature on Thursday that gives subscribers to its Prime service access to thousands of songs free and without interruptions from advertising.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amazon Introduces New Music Streaming Service', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '