icle/2c67a986-5df5-5ea1-8c2d-6338b9244334'}, {'abstract': 'Credit markets are once again badly mispricing risk. Many of the elements that caused the financial crisis are starting to align again, William D. Cohan writes in the Street Scene column.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/06/12/markets-are-restacking-the-building-blocks-of-a-financial-crisis/', 'snippet': 'Credit markets are once again badly mispricing risk. Many of the elements that caused the financial crisis are starting to align again, William D. Cohan writes in the Street Scene column.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If any of the ingredients that make up a new and powerful financial crisis are missing from the current commercial bouillabaisse, it is awfully difficult to discern just what they might be.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/business/dealbook/dbpix-tepper/dbpix-tepper-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/12/business/dealbook/dbpix-tepper/dbpix-tepper-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/business/dealbook/dbpix-tepper/dbpix-tepper-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/business/dealbook/dbpix-tepper/dbpix-tepper-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/business/dealbook/dbpix-tepper/dbpix-tepper-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_nam