0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/8fe0fc0b-6080-54f3-bfae-9f1aa3325f33'}, {'abstract': 'Two morning dance-party series are gaining popularity in New York, with live music, yoga and a bar serving coffee and juice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/13/nyregion/daybreaker-an-alcohol-free-morning-dance-party.html', 'snippet': 'Two morning dance-party series are gaining popularity in New York, with live music, yoga and a bar serving coffee and juice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THREE tall, glowing jellyfish puppets swept around the club floor, illuminating the broad grins and sweat-soaked brows of the wildly hopping dancers. Thumping house remixes of Tears for Fears’ “Everybody Wants to Rule the World” and Missy Elliott’s “Work It” rattled the balcony railings. Two D.J.s pumped their fists as a small pack of brass players appeared on the balcony, bleating along to the electronic soundtrack under stark strobe lights.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13DAYBREAKER/13DAYBREAKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 348, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13DAYBREAKER/13DAYBREAKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 348}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13DAYBREAKER/13DAYBREAKER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13DAYBREAKER/13DAYBREAKER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1187, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13DAY