g. This helps explain the Guggenheim’s UBS MAP Global Art Initiative, a three-phase collecting venture that finds the museum buying and showing the kinds of work it has paid little attention to in the past. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Arriving Late to the Party, but Dancing on All the Clichés', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Arriving Late to the Party, but Dancing on All the Clichés', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cotter, Holland', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Guggenheim, Solomon R, Museum', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Latin America', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pica, Amalia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Downey, Juan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bruguera, Tania', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bruscky, Paulo', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferrer, Rafael', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ortega, Damian', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Navarro, Ivan', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vieira da Silva, Marta', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jaar, Alfredo', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Camnitzer, Luis', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santiago, Daniel', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-12T21:35:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Holland Cotter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Holland', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cotter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role