d there seems to be enough food, gasoline and ammunition to keep everybody alert, mobile and angry. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Car Is Stolen, Setting Off an Angry Pursuit', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Car Is Stolen, Setting Off an Angry Pursuit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pearce, Guy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pattinson, Robert', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Michod, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Rover (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-12T21:49:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/651ddb6e-81bc-5744-8939-22a452e36522', 'word_count': 520, 'uri': 'nyt://article/651ddb6e-81bc-5744-8939-22a452e36522'}, {'abstract': 'Artists’s artists make up a highly select category. Poets’ artists occupy an even narrower niche, and George Schneeman filled it completely.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/13/arts/design/a-painter-and-his-poets-the-art-of-george-schneeman.html', 'snippet': 'Artists’s artists make up a highly select category. Poets’ artists occupy an even narrower niche, and George Schneeman filled it completely.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Poets House', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13GALLERIES2/GALLER