revolutionaries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/13/movies/in-policeman-from-israel-a-clash-of-ideologies.html', 'snippet': 'In the Israeli drama “Policeman,” an elite counterterrorism squad faces off with a band of youthful revolutionaries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are moments in “Policeman” when it feels as if the director Nadav Lapid is drawing one very large noose around his characters. That’s especially true early in this hypnotic, slow-building shocker from Israel, before the narrative pieces have slid into place, revealing Mr. Lapid’s intentions. Certainly, nothing looks out of the ordinary in the opening images of five men bicycling up a steep country road. That is until one, Yaron (Yiftach Klein), breaks away and begins riding so hard and fast toward the camera that he looks as if he might break through the screen.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13POLICEMAN/POLICEMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13POLICEMAN/POLICEMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13POLICEMAN/POLICEMAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13POLICEMAN/POLICEMAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1080, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/13/arts/13POLICEMAN/13POLICEMAN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thu