oday, and Who Is Getting Hired?’', 'kicker': 'Thomas L. Friedman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-12T22:32:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas L. Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63a33bb0-65ad-5089-915c-2ba5947c15ad', 'word_count': 1281, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63a33bb0-65ad-5089-915c-2ba5947c15ad'}, {'abstract': 'Laura Friedman of the Morningside Heights Historic District Committee responds to a Critic’s Notebook about the Cathedral Church of St. John the Divine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/13/opinion/the-cathedral-and-the-towers.html', 'snippet': 'Laura Friedman of the Morningside Heights Historic District Committee responds to a Critic’s Notebook about the Cathedral Church of St. John the Divine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Cathedral and the Towers', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Cathedral and the Towers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Historic Buildings and Sites', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cathedral Church of St John the Divine (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-12T22:35:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f383c4f-2ef7-5158-a1b9-c4d540165ebd', 'word_count': 230, 'uri': 'nyt://article