ls of the aughts — is officially relaunching her brand.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/13/in-fashion-the-return-of-alice-roi/', 'snippet': 'The New York-born-and-bred designer — a patron saint for stylish downtown girls of the aughts — is officially relaunching her brand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For girls-about-downtown in the late ’90s and early aughts, Alice Roi was a patron saint. The lower-Manhattan-born-and-bred designer with the cool-kid persona created clothes that tempered a girlish sensibility with a subtle sense of humor. There were the “La Caricature” dresses, covered in an Honoré Daumier print of two snobs turning their noses at each other. There were the Yeti-like mohair jackets and the bare-shouldered tops with cutouts meant to resemble crewneck openings. The line was a cult hit until 2008, when Roi became a mom and not only shuttered her business but withdrew completely from the fashion world.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/t-magazine/12roi-gonzalez-1/12roi-gonzalez-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/12/t-magazine/12roi-gonzalez-1/12roi-gonzalez-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/t-magazine/12roi-gonzalez-1/12roi-gonzalez-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/t-magazine/12roi-gonzalez-1/12roi-gonzalez-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/t-magazine/12roi-gonzalez-1/12roi-gonzalez-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/12/t-magazine/12roi-gonzalez-1/12roi-gonzalez-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/12/t-magazine/12roi-gonzalez-1/12roi-gonzalez-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Fashion | The Return of Alice Roi', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-13T13:53:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By sophia j. Gonzalez', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3f0478a-eb91-5f81-b392-bf0114313c42', 'word_count': 397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3f0478a-eb91-5f81-b392-bf0114313c42'}, {'abstract': 'The Friday before Father’s Day last year, my dad, an Alzheimer’s patient, wandered off from my mother at the grocery store. I’d been saying goodbye to him for almost a decade, but I wasn’t ready to lose him.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/13/a-lost-father-and-a-daughter-whos-not-ready-to-let-him-go/', 'snippet': 'The Friday before Father’s Day last year, my dad, an Alzheimer’s patient, wandered off from my mother at the grocery store. I’d been saying goodbye to him for almost a decade, but I wasn’t ready to lose him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While preparing my daughter for her preschool graduation ceremony last year, a text message buzzed my phone from my brother: “Dad has been missing for two hours.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'c