om/2014/06/13/heavy-lifting-from-the-vaults-lots-of-allmans-and-elvis-on-the-way/', 'snippet': 'A six-CD set of the Allman Brothers Band at the Fillmore East in 1971, and and eight-CD, two-DVD set of Elvis Presley performances will released this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Classic albums by the Allman Brothers Band and Elvis Presley are to be given expanded reissues that, depending on your level of fascination with these musicians, are either textbook examples of bloated archival sprawl or something like perfection.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Heavy Lifting From the Vaults: Lots of Allmans and Elvis on the Way', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Allmans and Elvis Sally From the Vaults', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Allman, Gregg', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Presley, Elvis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ALLMAN BROTHERS BAND', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Las Vegas (Nev)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-13T15:44:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9fd0ba9a-18c7-5848-86ff-7584eddb574e', 'word_count': 551, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9fd0ba9a-18c7-5848-86ff-7584eddb574e'}, {'abstract': 'What kind of leader does the G.O.P. need now?', 'web_url': 'https://douthat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/13/a-reagan-or-a-blair/', 'snippet': 'What kind of leade