a is settling back into its routine after a 16-month lockout and subsequent administrative drama, the orchestra has announced its 2014-15 season. And if that alone is not a clear enough sign, the orchestra and Osmo Vanska, its highly regarded music director – newly restored to his post after resigning during the dispute – plan to open its subscription season on Sept. 26 with Mahler’s “Resurrection” Symphony. (An opening gala with Renée Fleming, and a pair of performances outside the orchestra’s hall precede the Mahler, but surely Mr. Vanska and company want the symbolism to be clear.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Back From the Brink, Minnesota Orchestra Announces New Season', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vanska, Osmo', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Orchestra', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-13T16:10:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f3fb239-dec4-534d-95ce-ba2813d1626d', 'word_count': 312, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f3fb239-dec4-534d-95ce-ba2813d1626d'}, {'abstract': 'The Times critic Manohla Dargis reviews “22 Jump Street.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/movies/100000002938238/movie-review-22-jump-street.html', 'snippet': 'The Times critic Manohla Dargis reviews “22 Jump Street.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times critic Manohla Dargis reviews “22 Jump Street.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge',