aditions still hold cultural sway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A few years ago, it seemed like America might reject the wedding.\xa0Feminist criticisms\xa0of various wedding traditions gained steam; a New Yorker writer released a\xa0book\xa0on the ceremonies’ ballooning costs; the recession made couples\xa0scale back. The phrase “wedding-industrial complex” entered common parlance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/weekinreview/nyto-wedding/nyto-wedding-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/14/weekinreview/nyto-wedding/nyto-wedding-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/weekinreview/nyto-wedding/nyto-wedding-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1023, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/weekinreview/nyto-wedding/nyto-wedding-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1867, 'width': 1868, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/weekinreview/nyto-wedding/nyto-wedding-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/14/weekinreview/nyto-wedding/nyto-wedding-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/weekinreview/nyto-wedding/nyto-wedding-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'head