 effectiveness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/15/sunday-review/controlling-the-message-in-ukraine.html', 'snippet': 'Russian television has been whipping up anti-Kiev sentiment with unsettling effectiveness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DONETSK, Ukraine — IN the lush green fields here in Ukraine’s troubled east, I attended a funeral and a wedding over two days earlier this month. They presented vivid tableaux of contrasting emotions — one of fury, the other of fatalism — but each contained clues to the direction of things in this country on the edge of Europe whose eastern flank has risen up in open rebellion against the central government. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Orchestrated Conflict', 'kicker': 'Dispatch', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Orchestrated Conflict', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tavernise, Sabrina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-13T22:48:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sabrina Tavernise', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sabrina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tavernise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf82f89f-e0f5-5ecb-8469-9d8d7fcc43a8', 'word_count': 1123, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf82f89f-e0f5-5ecb-8469-9d8d7fcc43a8'}, {'abstract': 'Culinary students prepare meals and serve diners at restaurants-cum-classrooms in Hyde Park and New Rochelle.', 'web_url': 'htt