ion': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6dfa3434-de89-5426-9c03-d37c3cb178b8', 'word_count': 1168, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6dfa3434-de89-5426-9c03-d37c3cb178b8'}, {'abstract': 'Adnan A. Durrani’s Saffron Road food company has moved beyond a core audience of American Muslims and into the commercial mainstream, with annual sales approaching $35 million.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/14/us/a-muslim-entrepreneur-follows-a-kosher-model-to-success.html', 'snippet': 'Adnan A. Durrani’s Saffron Road food company has moved beyond a core audience of American Muslims and into the commercial mainstream, with annual sales approaching $35 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During the early months of 2010, Adnan A. Durrani found himself frequently thinking of kosher hot dogs. To be more precise, he was thinking of an ad campaign for them created decades earlier by the Hebrew National company. Its well-known slogan went, “We answer to a higher authority.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/nyregion/Y-14religion/Y-14religion-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/14/nyregion/Y-14religion/Y-14religion-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/nyregion/Y-14religion/Y-14religion-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/nyregion/Y-14religion/Y-14religion-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1420, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'ca