-8163-e6d1e7f73f09', 'word_count': 1022, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c649064-e9db-514f-8163-e6d1e7f73f09'}, {'abstract': 'The investigation will focus in part on the agency’s handling of roadway construction projects, according to several people briefed on the matter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/14/nyregion/sec-conducting-investigation-of-port-authority-projects.html', 'snippet': 'The investigation will focus in part on the agency’s handling of roadway construction projects, according to several people briefed on the matter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Port Authority of New York and New Jersey said this week that it is under investigation by the Securities and Exchange Commission, adding to the series of inquiries that have been ordered since the lane-closing scandal at the George Washington Bridge last year.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'S.E.C. Conducting Investigation of Port Authority Projects', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'S.E.C. Conducting Investigation of Port Authority Projects', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Port Authority of New York and New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'George Washington Bridge', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vance, Cyrus R Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-14T01:05:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27fe19dd-474c-58d7-be70-3f8a3700bd0d', 'word_count': 345, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27fe19dd-474c-58d7-be70-3f8a3700bd0d'}, {'abstract': 'Three universities, several community groups and others in Chicago are expected to submit proposals to the Barack Obama Foundation for the presidential library site.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/14/us/chicago-competes-against-itself-for-site-of-obama-presidential-library.html', 'snippet': 'Three universities, several community groups and others in Chicago are expected to submit proposals to the Barack Obama Foundation for the presidential library site.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — The tussle over the location of President Obama’s future presidential library seems to have come down to a debate over various places he has lived, including this city, New York City and Hawaii. Leaders from all three have been boasting lately of their relative assets as they lobby for the site, which they see as an honor, not to mention an economic driver. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/us/LIBRARY1/LIBRARY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/14/us/LIBRARY1/LIBRARY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/us/LIBRARY1/LIBRARY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/us/LIBRARY1/LIBRARY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 