ve been shockingly one-sided, with the Spurs relying on lethal shooting and talented role players to put the defending champion Heat on the verge of being dethroned.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/14/sports/basketball/spurs-have-made-nba-finals-anything-but-close.html', 'snippet': 'The N.B.A. finals have been shockingly one-sided, with the Spurs relying on lethal shooting and talented role players to put the defending champion Heat on the verge of being dethroned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.B.A. finals were billed as a repeat of one of the most competitive series in history. The defending champion Miami Heat may have won their 2012-13 series against the Spurs, but you had to really squint to see the difference between the two teams. At the end of seven intense games, the San Antonio Spurs had actually outscored the Miami Heat by five points. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/sports/CITY-BECKLEY/CITY-BECKLEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 610, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/14/sports/CITY-BECKLEY/CITY-BECKLEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 610}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/sports/CITY-BECKLEY/CITY-BECKLEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1008, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/sports/CITY-BECKLEY/CITY-BECKLEY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2016, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/14/sports/CITY-BECKLEY/CITY-BECKLEY-thumbStandard.jpg'