rgan injured brings attention to the lobbying efforts of the trucking industry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/14/opinion/the-trucking-industry-wants-to-weaken-safety-rules.html', 'snippet': 'The fatal accident that left the actor Tracy Morgan injured brings attention to the lobbying efforts of the trucking industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Days before an accident in which an allegedly drowsy truck driver crashed into a van carrying the actor Tracy Morgan, critically injuring him and killing another passenger, a Senate committee voted to roll back regulations meant to keep fatigued truckers off the nation’s highways.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drowsy Drivers, Dangerous Highways', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Drowsy Drivers, Dangerous Highways', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trucks and Trucking', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lobbying and Lobbyists', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morgan, Tracy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Driver Distraction and Fatigue', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-14T02:42:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9bc0ed8f-b1e3-52e1-8b90-820d76e7