uy it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/14/sports/hockey/talk-of-puck-luck-bounces-both-ways-for-both-teams.html', 'snippet': 'The Stanley Cup finals saw its share of weird bounces and deflections. While the Rangers believed “the hockey gods” may have played a part in the series, the Kings did not buy it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — It’s called puck luck, and it would seem to be an appropriate phrase for some of the bounces, deflections and goal-line theatrics that threaded their way through the Stanley Cup finals. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Talk of Puck Luck Bounces Both Ways for Both Teams', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Talk of Puck Luck Bounces Both Ways for Both Teams', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Knoll, Andrew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stanley Cup', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Kings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Girardi, Dan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vigneault, Alain', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Justin (1981- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-14T05:32:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Knoll', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Knoll', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d0109ec6-d2ca-572b-841a-2f85be78692a', 'word_count': 575, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0109ec6-d2ca-572b-841a-2f85be78692a'}, {'abstract': 'Noll took a Pittsburgh team that had been a perennial doormat and turned it into a powerhouse.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/15/sports/football/chuck-noll-coach-of-steelers-dynasty-in-1970s-dies-at-82.html', 'snippet': 'Noll took a Pittsburgh team that had been a perennial doormat and turned it into a powerhouse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chuck Noll, who built the “Steel Curtain” Pittsburgh Steelers of the 1970s into one of the most dominant teams in pro football history, becoming the only N.F.L. coach to win four Super Bowl championships, died on Friday at his home in Sewickley, Pa., outside Pittsburgh. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/noll-obit-1/noll-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/noll-obit-1/noll-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/noll-obit-1/noll-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/noll-obit-1/noll-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1515, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/noll-obit-1/noll-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/noll-obit-1/noll-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbn