: 'nyt://video/e5ad74f8-ca36-582b-9e3d-d1cd38a1ea84'}, {'abstract': 'Patty Mills of the San Antonio Spurs flies three flags: of Australia, the Aboriginals and the Torres Strait Islands, and like many Australians he continues to wrestle with complex questions of culture and heritage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/15/sports/basketball/the-diverse-heritage-of-san-antonio-spurs-patty-mills.html', 'snippet': 'Patty Mills of the San Antonio Spurs flies three flags: of Australia, the Aboriginals and the Torres Strait Islands, and like many Australians he continues to wrestle with complex questions of culture and heritage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN ANTONIO — Benny Mills, it appears, is the type of man who is incapable of speaking without a smile, one that instantly gives his cherubic face an impish glint. His wife, Yvonne, is a more serious study, a woman who chooses her words carefully, as if they are irrevocable, and speaks them with a quiet force.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/DOG-SPURS-1/DOG-SPURS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/DOG-SPURS-1/DOG-SPURS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/DOG-SPURS-1/DOG-SPURS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/15/sports/DOG-SPURS-1/DOG-SPURS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 