ho work in the radio business took to Twitter to pay their respects to Casey Kasem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kerri Kasem used her Facebook page on Sunday to announce the death of her father, Casey Kasem. She described the family as “heartbroken.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Casey Kasem Remembered on Twitter', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kasem, Casey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moe, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seacrest, Ryan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sirius XM Radio Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-15T17:15:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Roston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/953ffd15-b479-5eb8-940b-cf20878eba41', 'word_count': 373, 'uri': 'nyt://article/953ffd15-b479-5eb8-940b-cf20878eba41'}, {'abstract': 'Casey Kasem, the longtime host of the syndicated radio show “American Top 40,” homogenized pop, playing the same tunes coast to coast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/16/arts/music/remembering-casey-kasem-dj-for-a-more-eclectic-pop-radio.html', 'snippet': 'Casey Kasem, the longtime host of the syndicated radio show “American Top 40,” homogenized pop, playing the same tunes coast to coast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The music didn’t matter that much on “American Top 40,” the syndicated radio countdown show devised by Casey Kasem and a handful of Los Angeles radio colleagues. Individual songs might advance steadily toward No. 1, stall out along the way, suddenly leapfrog into the Top 10 or peak early and plummet. They would come and go: rock or pop, soul or country, hip-hop or synth-pop. The format would hold them all. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Host in a Big-Tent Era of Pop Music', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Host in a Big-Tent Era of Pop Music', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kasem, Casey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disc Jockeys', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-15T17:22:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Pareles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pareles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b77e7a4f-3021-54ee-8b79-924c12e025b3', 'word_count': 1068, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b77e7a4f-3021-54ee-8b79-924c12e025b3'}, {'abstract': 'After fighter jets pounded militant targets in North Waziristan, the military announced that it had launched a “comprehensive operation” against militants in the region.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/16/world/asia/pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'After fighter jets pounded militant targets in North Waziristan, the military announced that it had launched a “comprehensive operation” against militants in the region.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PESHAWAR, Pakistan — Ending years of hesitation, Pakistan’s military on Sunday said it was launching a major military operation aga