’s Guide to Love & Murder” won the Tony for best musical, its producers are changing their marketing strategy in the hope of turning an acclaimed show into a long-running hit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/16/theater/theaterspecial/tony-for-best-musical-is-nice-but-a-profitable-hit-is-better.html', 'snippet': 'Since “A Gentleman’s Guide to Love & Murder” won the Tony for best musical, its producers are changing their marketing strategy in the hope of turning an acclaimed show into a long-running hit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All winter and spring, the Broadway producer Joey Parnes wore his game face to the advertising meetings at 11:30 a.m. Wednesdays for his $7.5 million musical “A Gentleman’s Guide to Love & Murder.” The show was losing money most weeks, and his big bet — that the June 8 Tony Awards could be a game changer — was a ways off and hardly a sure thing.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/16/arts/gentleman/gentleman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/16/arts/gentleman/gentleman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/16/arts/gentleman/gentleman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/16/arts/gentleman/gentleman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1355, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/16/arts/gentleman/gentleman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wid