h/thinking-of-ways-to-harm-her.html', 'snippet': 'Studies are revealing a more complex view of maternal mental illness, including that what is known as postpartum depression often begins during pregnancy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Postpartum depression isn’t always postpartum. It isn’t even always depression. A fast-growing body of research is changing the very definition of maternal mental illness, showing that it is more common and varied than previously thought.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Thinking of Ways to Harm Her’', 'kicker': "Mother's Mind: First of Two Articles", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '&#8216;Thinking of Ways to Harm Her&#8217;', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belluck, Pam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Depression (Mental)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Therapy and Rehabilitation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Series', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-16T03:36:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pam Belluck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belluck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/51a1a2d9-563d-5f35-a946-227ff2a9ff13', 'word_count': 1975, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51a1a2d9-563d-5f35-a946-227ff2a9ff13'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Monday, June 16, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/16/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-monday-may-16-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Monday, June 16, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I don’t know if you call it a problem or a weakness, but it’s clear that the American nature is to try and make everything fair, to try and be fair to the game.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Monday, June 16, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-16T03:59:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/f76f3e7d-a86f-54ba-b79a-b3ce9ec41145', 'word_count': 48, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f76f3e7d-a86f-54ba-b79a-b3ce9ec41145'}, {'abstract': 'Designed by the creative director of the Jardin Majorelle, Restaurant Numero 7 recently reopened with a chef-in-residence program that is bringing in noteworthy talent like Jerome Waag of Chez Panisse.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/16/t-magazine/fez-restaurant-numero-seven.html', 'snippet': 'Designed by the creative director of the Jardin Majorelle, Restaurant Numero 7 recently reopened with a chef-in-residence program that is bringing in noteworthy talent like Jerome Waag of Chez Panisse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Deep in the hive-like medina (old city) of Fez, Morocco, one of the world’s most beautiful restaurants has just reopened as a venue for an intriguing new visiting-chef-in-residence project that casts the kitchen as an incubator for both cultural exchange and culinary innovation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'capt