ois Lerner, had been destroyed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/17/us/house-panels-looking-into-irss-claims-of-lost-emails.html', 'snippet': 'The I.R.S. told investigators looking into accusations of politically motivated misconduct that two years’ worth of emails sent and received by an official, Lois Lerner, had been destroyed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Internal Revenue Service commissioner will testify before two House committees next week about the agency’s disclosure that it lost thousands of emails sought by investigators looking into accusations of politically motivated misconduct by the agency, the committees said Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/us/LERNER/LERNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 773, 'width': 556, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/us/LERNER/LERNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 773, 'width': 556, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/us/LERNER/LERNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/17/us/LERNER/LERNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/us/LERNER/LERNER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'I.R.S. Commissioner to Testify on Ex-Official’s Lost Emails', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'I.R.S. Commissioner to Testify on E