elivery of aid had become harder since President Bashar al-Assad claimed re-election on June 3.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/17/world/europe/syrian-government-making-aid-delivery-more-difficult-un-official-says.html', 'snippet': 'The United Nations chief aid coordinator said the delivery of aid had become harder since President Bashar al-Assad claimed re-election on June 3.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — The government of President Bashar al-Assad is making it harder to deliver humanitarian aid to millions of war-battered civilians in Syria, the United Nations chief aid coordinator, Valerie Amos, said on Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Syrian Government Making Aid Delivery More Difficult, U.N. Official Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Syria: Aid Impeded, U.N. Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cumming-Bruce, Nick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Amos, Valerie Ann', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-16T18:36:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Cumming-Bruce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f179795-733f-5c70-935f-31d0e5fe1c86', 'word_count': 393, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f179795-733f-5c70-935f-31d0e5fe1c86'}, {'abstract': 'Broadway producers want to revive A.R. Gurney’s play at the Vivian Beaumont Theater; casting is not yet set.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/16/producers-aim-to-bring-love-letters-to-broadway-this-fall/', 'snippet': 'Broadway producers want to revive A.R. Gurney’s play at the Vivian Beaumont Theater; casting is not yet set.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Broadway revival is in the works for A.R. Gurney’s “Love Letters,” a two-character epistolary play that has long been a favorite of famous actors, with producers aiming to mount the show at the Vivian Beaumont Theater in the fall. The director would be the Tony nominee Gregory Mosher (Broadway’s “A View from the Bridge” in 2009-10) and the lead producers include Nelle Nugent (“The Trip to Bountiful” in 2013), Barbara Broccoli (the James Bond movie series) and Fred Zollo (“Once”), according to two Broadway producers who are not involved with the show but are familiar with the plans.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/16/theater/16gurney/16gurney-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 726, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/16/theater/16gurney/16gurney-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 726}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/16/theater/16gurney/16gurney-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 847, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/16/theater/16gurney/16gurney-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1059, 'width': 875, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/