 of young men head to Europe, hoping it will be the start of their modeling careers. “I think that most people think that when you become a model, you don’t have to worry anymore about money,” said Tomas Gajdos, a 17-year-old high school student from Slovakia who was discovered by a modeling agent while riding the London Tube. “But, it isn’t so easy as it maybe looks.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Making of a Male Model', 'kicker': 'Video', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'London Fashion Week', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-16T20:22:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Fashion', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Fritzie Andrade and Taige Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Fritzie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Andrade', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Taige', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ee3a720-7e8f-5542-b00d-6530a12186a9', 'word_count': 126, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ee3a720-7e8f-5542-b00d-6530a12186a9'}, {'abstract': 'The $978 million acquisition of BR Towers, backed by the private equity firm GP Investments, follows American Tower’s purchase last year of 2,800 cellphone towers in Brazil from NII Holdings.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/06/16/american-tower-expands-cellphone-tower-holdings-in-brazil/', 'snippet': 'The $978 million acquisition of BR Towers, backed by the private equity firm GP Investments, follows American Tower’s purchase last year of 2,800 cellphone towers in Brazil from NII Holdings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SÃO PAULO, Brazil — The American Tower Corporation has agreed to acquire a Brazilian cellphone tower company, BR Towers, backed by the private equity firm GP Investments, for about $978 million, the companies said in regulatory filings on Sunday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'American Tower Expands Cellphone Tower Holdings in Brazil', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN TOWER CORP', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BR Towers SA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-16T20:28:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vinod Sreeharsha', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vinod', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sreeharsha', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e38e298a-4b12-5443-9079-93eaba60f940', 'word_count': 631, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e38e298a-4b12-5443-9079-93eaba60f940'}, {'abstract': 'With his new project, Eternal Lips, the veteran artist Grey Gersten surrenders to the joys of pop music, as seen in the video for “Voice,” which stars a diminutive Michael Jackson impersonator and premieres here.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/16/eternal-lips-grey-gersten-music-video/', 'snippet': 'With his new project, Eternal Lips, the veteran artist Grey Gersten surrenders to the joys of pop music, as seen in the video for “Voice,” which stars a diminutive Michael Jackson impersonator and premieres here.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I avoided pop music for a long time,” says Grey Gersten, a veteran of the Brooklyn indie music scene, of his new pop-minded solo project Eternal Lips. “I thought pop was all about consumerism. Then I realized pop was about dreams and fantasy.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Listen Up | A Brooklyn Experimental Musician Gets in Touch With His Inner Michael Jackson', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TV on the Radio (Music Group)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-16T20:30:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By MATT DIEHL', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'DIEHL', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/df810d21-77d0-5847-bbe9-848431b35f08', 'word_count': 438, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df810d21-77d0-5847-bbe9-848431b35f08'}, {'abstract': '“The Good Doctor” is more than a son’s search to understand his father’s actions, but an evaluation of a generation that practiced medicine differently.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/17/health/the-good-doctor-a-sons-look-at-an-earlier-generation.html', 'snippet': '“The Good Doctor” is more than a son’s search to understand his father’s actions, but an evaluation of a generation that practiced medicine differently.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a career that spanned more than five decades, from the 1950s into the 21st century, Dr. Phillip I. Lerner witnessed vast transformations in medicine. But as his son, Dr. Barron H. Lerner, writes in this exquisitely insightful new memoir, none of the changes was more profound than the evolution of the doctor-patient relationship. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/science/17SCIB/17SCIB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/17/science/17SCIB/17SCIB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/science/17SCIB/17SCIB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/science/17SCIB/17SCIB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/science/17SCIB/17SCIB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/17/science/17SCIB/17SCIB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/science/17SCIB/17SCIB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Father, Doctor, Role Model', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Father, Doctor, Role Model', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hafner, Katie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lerner, Barron H', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject