, William J. Bratton is using many of the same techniques he developed in the high-crime early 1990s, though the city is far calmer now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/17/nyregion/for-a-much-safer-new-york-bratton-redefines-role.html', 'snippet': 'In his second tour as police commissioner, William J. Bratton is using many of the same techniques he developed in the high-crime early 1990s, though the city is far calmer now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his office on the 14th floor of Police Headquarters, William J. Bratton displays copies of his memoir, “Turnaround,” his account of taming New York’s crime-filled streets and subways in the 1990s. On a mostly empty wall hangs a framed Time magazine cover from 1996, declaring over a steely photo of Mr. Bratton: “Finally, We’re Winning the War Against Crime. Here’s Why.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/sports/17BRATTON-hp/17BRATTON-hp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/17/sports/17BRATTON-hp/17BRATTON-hp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/sports/17BRATTON-hp/17BRATTON-hp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/sports/17BRATTON-hp/17BRATTON-hp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/sports/17BRATTON-hp/17BRATTON-hp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subT