ory.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Estée Lauder Goes Long on Men’s Skin Care', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deodorants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arnault, Antoine', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lauder, Estee', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Berluti', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brioni (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Clinique', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Estee Lauder Companies Inc', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton SA', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-17T13:24:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vanessa Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vanessa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2ff2c0ea-837d-560c-920c-572ba76e5d26', 'word_count': 533, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ff2c0ea-837d-560c-920c-572ba76e5d26'}, {'abstract': 'Lawmakers zeroed in on payments that firms like TD Ameritrade accept for routing customer orders to particular exchanges or trading firms.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/06/17/trader-who-called-markets-rigged-tempers-his-critique/', 'snippet': 'Lawmakers zeroed in on payments that firms like TD Ameritrade accept for routing customer orders to particular exchanges or trading firms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 10:43 a.m. | WASHINGTON – TD Ameritrade, a brokerage firm that handles vast numbers of stock trades for average investors, promises to execute those orders on the best possible terms.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/business/dbpix-trading2/dbpix-trading2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/18/business/dbpix-trading2/dbpix-trading2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/business/dbpix-trading2/dbpix-trading2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/business/dbpix-trading2/dbpix-trading2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/business/dbpix-trading2/dbpix-trading2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/18/business/dbpix-trading2/dbpix-trading2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/business/dbpix-trading2/dbpix-trading2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Senate Hearing, Brokerag