right wig” silkscreen painting was sold to an unnamed private American buyer.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/17/an-80s-warhol-brings-30-million-at-art-basel/', 'snippet': 'The 1986 Warhol “fright wig” silkscreen painting was sold to an unnamed private American buyer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BASEL, Switzerland — An Andy Warhol self-portrait priced at more than $30 million led the rush of early sales at the V.I.P. preview of Art Basel, the world’s pre-eminent fair devoted to modern and contemporary art. The 45th edition of this event, held at a time when auction prices of contemporary art are booming, features hundreds of international galleries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/17artsbeat-basel/17artsbeat-basel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/17artsbeat-basel/17artsbeat-basel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/17artsbeat-basel/17artsbeat-basel-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/17artsbeat-basel/17artsbeat-basel-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/17artsbeat-basel/17artsbeat-basel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/17artsbeat-basel/17artsbeat-basel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75,