mes.com/2014/06/18/arts/music/ariadne-greifs-searing-moment-in-opera-cabals-atthis.html', 'snippet': 'The soprano Ariadne Greif ripped off strips of duct tape that bound her naked torso as part of Opera Cabal’s powerful production of “Atthis” at the Kitchen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Kitchen in Chelsea is not a big performance space. So when Ariadne Greif, the soprano starring in Opera Cabal’s production of Georg Friedrich Haas’s “Atthis,” came to the front of the stage on Thursday evening, stepped out of her dress and began to tear off the metallic-looking strips of duct tape that girded her naked torso, even the last row of audience members got a close-up of what must be one of the most searingly painful and revealing operatic performances in recent times.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/ariadne/ariadne-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/ariadne/ariadne-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/ariadne/ariadne-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/ariadne/ariadne-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1509, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/ariadne/ariadne-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/18/arts/ariadne/ariadne-thumbStandard.jp