28-ada165a5bb4a', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ad624f5-d7ef-5b4a-bf28-ada165a5bb4a'}, {'abstract': 'Facebook on Tuesday unveiled its latest social offering, Slingshot, which is designed to allow people to send ephemeral messages. The web had a lot to say about this latest offering.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/17/the-non-ephemeral-web-reacts-to-facebooks-slingshot/', 'snippet': 'Facebook on Tuesday unveiled its latest social offering, Slingshot, which is designed to allow people to send ephemeral messages. The web had a lot to say about this latest offering.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Facebook unveiled Poke\xa0last year, a\xa0service that enabled people to send photos, messages and videos with a built-in shelf life,\xa0the tech world thought it was trouble for Snapchat, a competing vanishing messaging service.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/technology/17bits-slingshot2/17bits-slingshot2-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 499, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/technology/17bits-slingshot2/17bits-slingshot2-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1130, 'width': 550, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/technology/17bits-slingshot2/17bits-slingshot2-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/17/technology/17bits-slingshot2/17bits-slingshot2-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/technology/17bits-slingshot2/17bits-s