qiang-begins-visit-to-britain/', 'snippet': 'The prime minister’s visit comes after a period of cool political relations between China and Britain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After an exchange of unflattering comments between the Chinese and British sides threatened to overshadow Prime Minister Li Keqiang’s trip to Britain, sunny skies greeted him on Tuesday, the first full day of his visit. Following a meeting with Queen Elizabeth II in the morning, the second-ranking Chinese leader met with Prime Minister David Cameron at 10 Downing Street for talks and lunch with business leaders.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/world/17sino-li/17sino-li-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/17/world/17sino-li/17sino-li-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/world/17sino-li/17sino-li-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/world/17sino-li/17sino-li-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1343, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/world/17sino-li/17sino-li-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/17/world/17sino-li/17sino-li-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/world/17sino-li/17sino-li-thum