mary-j-blige.html', 'snippet': 'The performance by the British soul singer Sam Smith was a showcase for his vocal calisthenics and achingly beautiful songs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At this point, the Apollo Theater exists largely in totemic form, a repository of credibility available for loan to those seeking to cloak themselves in its legacy, whether out of homage or insecurity. Its meaning is fungible, whatever its occupant for the night needs it to be.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/arts/19SAMSMITH/19SAMSMITH-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 443, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/19/arts/19SAMSMITH/19SAMSMITH-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 443}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/arts/19SAMSMITH/19SAMSMITH-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/arts/19SAMSMITH/19SAMSMITH-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1511, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/arts/19SAMSMITH/19SAMSMITH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/19/arts/19SAMSMITH/19SAMSMITH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/arts/19SAMSMITH/19SAMSMITH-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', '