77-46089ec57b9c'}, {'abstract': 'Acoustic rockers Death Has No Dominion explore the rooftops of Paris in a new video.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/18/death-has-no-dominion-danish-rock-band-new-video/', 'snippet': 'Acoustic rockers Death Has No Dominion explore the rooftops of Paris in a new video.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In their early 20s, Rasmus Bak and Bjarke Niemann bonded over a shared love of ambient music. Nearly 10 years later, on a whim, the Danish pals embarked on a journey from Copenhagen to upstate New York, where they spent seven days with 20 bottles of wine and two ukuleles in the Rubber House, a desolate black building covered with neoprene sheeting once owned by the actor Willem Dafoe. There, isolated from the outside world and surrounded by woods, their new musical project, Death Has No Dominion, was born.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/t-magazine/18death-oloizia/18death-oloizia-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/18/t-magazine/18death-oloizia/18death-oloizia-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/t-magazine/18death-oloizia/18death-oloizia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/t-magazine/18death-oloizia/18death-oloizia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/18/t-magazine/18death-oloizia/18death-oloizia-thumbStandard.jpg',