cle', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'World Cup', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Lyall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/84b16e8e-02fe-5185-96a5-5b01d93c90df', 'word_count': 1136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84b16e8e-02fe-5185-96a5-5b01d93c90df'}, {'abstract': 'Do reservation apps usefully provide a way for people to  get into popular restaurants, or are they just another way to sell what was once free?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2014/06/18/should-restaurant-reservations-be-for-sale/', 'snippet': 'Do reservation apps usefully provide a way for people to  get into popular restaurants, or are they just another way to sell what was once free?', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Should Restaurant Reservations Be for Sale? ', 'kicker': 'Room for Debate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-19T01:02:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a9a226d5-1fc9-56bf-9b5a-52310f84a6e3', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a9a226d5-1fc9-56bf-9b5a-52310f84a6e3'}, {'abstract': 'It is time for a change in New York’s 13th Congressional District. The Times recommends Adriano Espaillat, a state senator, for the House seat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/19/opinion/espaillat-for-congress.html', 'snippet': 'It is time for a change in New York’s 13th Congressional District. The Times recommends Adriano Espaillat, a state senator, for the House seat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a humiliating censure by Congress four years ago for failing to pay taxes and other ethical lapses, Representative Charles Rangel has steadily lost power in Washington. After nearly 44 years in office, it is now time for him to yield to the next generation. In Tuesday’s Democratic primary for New York’s 13th Congressional District, we recommend Adriano Espaillat, a New York State senator, who will be a better representative of this district stretching from Upper Manhattan into parts of the Bronx. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Espaillat for Congress', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Espaillat for Congress', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Espaillat, Adriano D', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endorsements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Harlem (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rangel, Charles B', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-19T01:02:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a175d3d-3e35-5a96-ad51-14454733e90d', 'word_count': 241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a175d3d-3e35-5a96-ad51-14454733e90d'}, {'abstract': 'States should change their laws to classify bringing a gun into security checkpoints as a felony.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/19/opinion/guns-at-the-airport.html', 'snippet': 'States should change their laws to classify bringing a gun into security checkpoints as a felony.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On June 4, a 32-year-old woman tried to get through security at San Antonio International Airport with a loaded .380 caliber Diamondback in her carry-on bag. This wasn’t a freak occurrence. Transportation Security Administration officials intercepted 18 guns on that day alone — a single-day record in what looks to be a record-setting year. The T.S.A. found 1,320 guns in 2011, 1,556 in 2012, 1,813 in 2013 — and has found roughly 900 so far in 2014.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Guns at the Airport', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Guns at the Airport', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transportation Security Administration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-19T01:03:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/f87d39b5-c7ca-5e7d-8926-4669692130f8', 'word_count': 365, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f87d39b5-c7ca-5e7d-8926-4669692130f8'}, {'abstract': 'There was a sense of pity in seeing a legend fall so unexpectedly, and appear so helpless, in Spain’s loss to Chile, in which a death knell clanged for most of the game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/19/sports/worldcup/mighty-spain-goes-out-of-the-world-cup-meekly.html', 'snippet': 'There was a sense of pity in seeing a legend fall so unexpectedly, and appear so helpless, in Spain’s loss to Chile, in which a death knell clanged for most of the game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RIO DE JANEIRO — The chants at the game between Spain and Chile began slowly, first from one side of Estádio do Maracanã, then from the other. By the time the final minutes had ticked off the clock Wednesday, tens of thousands of fans had joined in.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/sports/subMACUR1/subMACUR1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/19/sports/subMACUR1/subMACUR1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/sports/subMACUR1/subMACUR1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/sports/subMACUR1/subMACUR1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1267, 'width': 1901, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/sports/subMACUR1/subMACUR1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/19/sports/subMACUR1/subMACUR1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/sports/subMACUR1/subMACUR1-thumbLarg