bipartisan deal reached in the state Senate, represented a slimmer package than the 23 bills passed last week by the Senate. They aim to increase access to addiction treatment and raise penalties for illegal opioid sales.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/19/nyregion/new-york-plans-more-laws-to-fight-heroin-problem.html', 'snippet': 'The 11 bills, a bipartisan deal reached in the state Senate, represented a slimmer package than the 23 bills passed last week by the Senate. They aim to increase access to addiction treatment and raise penalties for illegal opioid sales.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the second time in two weeks, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo gathered reporters on Wednesday to make an announcement about the state’s heroin problem, which has dominated discussions at the close of the legislative session in Albany. Last week, flanked by law enforcement officers, the governor was behind a lectern emblazoned with the words “Heroin Epidemic.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/nyregion/y-NYHEROIN/y-NYHEROIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/19/nyregion/y-NYHEROIN/y-NYHEROIN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/nyregion/y-NYHEROIN/y-NYHEROIN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/nyregion/y-NYHEROIN/y-NYHEROIN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '