s in Williamsburg, eventually settling at Cameo gallery. Since then, it’s become a destination for pros to work out new material (famous names like Aziz Ansari, Zach Galifianakis, John Mulaney and Sarah Silverman have been known to drop by) and for up-and-comers to earn their stripes.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19silvestri-ortved/19silvestri-ortved-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19silvestri-ortved/19silvestri-ortved-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19silvestri-ortved/19silvestri-ortved-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 588, 'width': 979, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19silvestri-ortved/19silvestri-ortved-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 588, 'width': 979, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19silvestri-ortved/19silvestri-ortved-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19silvestri-ortved/19silvestri-ortved-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19silvestri-ortved/19silvestri-ortved-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'lega