c41c8e'}, {'abstract': 'The movie “Boyhood” was filmed over the course of a dozen years. Its star, Ellar Coltrane, practically grew up on film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/22/magazine/richard-linklaters-leading-boy.html', 'snippet': 'The movie “Boyhood” was filmed over the course of a dozen years. Its star, Ellar Coltrane, practically grew up on film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his new film, “Boyhood,” the director Richard Linklater takes a novel approach to the classic coming-of-age story — one that’s both strikingly radical and entirely logical. Filmed in short installments over a period of 12 years, “Boyhood” details the journey from boyhood to adolescence of one Mason Jr., played by Ellar Coltrane, above, who blossoms on screen before our eyes from a pensive, tentative 6-year-old to a sensitive, freethinking young man of 18.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '38', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Richard Linklater’s Leading Boy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '12 Years a Boy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coltrane, Ellar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marchese, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Linklater, Richard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Boyhood (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-19T14:48:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Marchese', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Marchese', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7cceb7a8-