{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nordland, Rod', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jabr, Bayan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chalabi, Ahmad', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mahdi, Adel Abdul', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-19T15:09:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alissa J. Rubin and Rod Nordland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alissa', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Rubin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rod', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nordland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/095ac008-b0bd-560a-aa3b-ffd0b8b4433e', 'word_count': 1452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/095ac008-b0bd-560a-aa3b-ffd0b8b4433e'}, {'abstract': 'The look, presented in retro colorways, had a kind of ’70s-by-way-of-the-’90s vibe.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/19/striped-knits-london-fashion-week-spring-runway-trend-jw-anderson-pringle-of-scotland-topman/', 'snippet': 'The look, presented in retro colorways, had a kind of ’70s-by-way-of-the-’90s vibe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Instead of the now ubiquitous nautical stripes, designers at the spring/summer 2015 London men’s shows presented variegated striped knits in retro colorways, with a ’70s-by-way-of-the-’90s feeling. They’re the kind of sweaters that the Blur frontman Damon Albarn might have worn circa “Parklife,” or Harmony Korine might have slipped into while he was writing “Kids.” At Topman, a mockneck was paired with bell bottoms (and alternately layered under a short-sleeve daisy-printed shirt). Pringle of Scotland offered a tailored version of the retro golf sweater, worn with suit pants. Meanwhile, continuing his exploration of gender boundaries, J.W. Anderson presented the throwback striped look in the form of a knotted boatneck.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19trend-rider/19trend-rider-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19trend-rider/19trend-rider-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19trend-rider/19trend-rider-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19trend-rider/19trend-rider-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19trend-rider/19trend-rider-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19trend-rider/19trend-rider-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19trend-rider/19trend-rider-thumbLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Three’s a Trend | Striped Knits on the London Runways', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 's