 through and look for anything that was different,” he says. “The closest thing I could usually find was either jazz or swing.” By his teens, his love for soul had taken hold.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19movement-oloizia/19movement-oloizia-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19movement-oloizia/19movement-oloizia-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19movement-oloizia/19movement-oloizia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19movement-oloizia/19movement-oloizia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19movement-oloizia/19movement-oloizia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19movement-oloizia/19movement-oloizia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/t-magazine/19movement-oloizia/19movement-oloizia-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Listen Up | A New Indie Label With an Old Soul', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kiwanuka, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-19T17:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Oloizia', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Oloizia', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5a2765ef-b5e7-5350-925e-d96df1aa040d', 'word_count': 383, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5a2765ef-b5e7-5350-925e-d96df1aa040d'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Wooster’s capsule collection, to debut at the Pitti men’s fair in Italy, is just one of the products of his web fame.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/21/fashion/Nick-Wooster-Instagram-Mens-Fashion-Design-Debut-at-Pitti-Uomo.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Wooster’s capsule collection, to debut at the Pitti men’s fair in Italy, is just one of the products of his web fame.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORENCE, Italy — He is an Instagram idol, an object of veneration across social media platforms, the sole focus of blogs consecrated to charting his individual style. That style, which the fashion retailer and savant Nickelson Wooster spent decades retooling, has lately become influential enough in the age of image obsession that a cadre of street photographers tracks him wherever he goes.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/fashion/19WOOSTERSPAN/19WOOSTERSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/20/fashion/19WOOSTERSPAN/19WOOSTERSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {