 confident in Congress, a new low, but that won’t keep us from re-electing our local representatives.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dear Congress: Our relationship has soured. I no longer have confidence in you. I’ve asked my friends, and they all agree. Only 7 percent of my fellow Americans now tell Gallup they have either a “great deal” or “quite of lot” of confidence in you. A mere 15 percent approve of the way you’re handling your job. They never really liked your friends — big business, organized labor and the banks — but now they tell me they have more confidence in each of them than they have in you.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Congress and Us: A Hate-Love Relationship', 'kicker': 'Pulse of the People', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-19T20:36:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Justin Wolfers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Justin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wolfers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0222edb-1067-5806-bf91-1cada61bd9d9', 'word_count': 470, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0222edb-1067-5806-bf91-1cada61bd9d9'}, {'abstract': 'Your nightly briefing is ready for you.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/19/us/your-evening-briefing.html', 'snippet': 'Your nightly briefing is ready for you.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Welcome to NYT Now, the new app from The New York Times.', 'source': 'Th