uckily for the crew in TNT’s new series “The Last Ship,” television has been ending the world almost since the medium was invented. Here are some survival tips.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/22/arts/television/survival-lessons-for-the-crew-of-the-last-ship.html', 'snippet': 'Luckily for the crew in TNT’s new series “The Last Ship,” television has been ending the world almost since the medium was invented. Here are some survival tips.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You know the feeling. You emerge from a nap in your wine cellar or from a month in a submarine to find that during your absence, civilization has been destroyed, and only you, and perhaps a few other people, are left alive. You’re panicky. Grief stricken. Bummed. Full of impotent rage. Perhaps even a little gleeful.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/arts/22LASTSHIP1/22LASTSHIP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/22/arts/22LASTSHIP1/22LASTSHIP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/arts/22LASTSHIP1/22LASTSHIP1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/arts/22LASTSHIP1/22LASTSHIP1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/arts/22LASTSHIP1/22LASTSHIP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'t