ummer doesn’t officially begin until tomorrow, stores have already begun to stock autumn/winter 2014 collections. But beneath the onslaught of warm outerwear and cozy sweaters, you can still find some seasonally appropriate spring/summer pieces. There are separates and accessories inspired by both the fashion and architecture of Morocco. The exotic prints embraced by designers like Isabel Marant, Tod’s and Emamò are as colorful as the country’s inhabitants, evoking the graphic tiles that line the riads and the vivid shades that pop throughout the spicy perfumed souks of Marrakesh. Whether worn together in some far off corner of the world or as part of an otherwise minimalist outfit, these bohemian accents are worth the hunt. (And soon, they could end up on sale!)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20market-gilchrist/20market-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20market-gilchrist/20market-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20market-gilchrist/20market-gilchrist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20market-gilchrist/20market-gilchrist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20market-gilchrist/20market-gilchrist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop