Toronto, the Yankees relied on the baserunning abilities of Jacoby Ellsbury, Brian Roberts and Brett Gardner, all of whom helped manufacture runs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/20/sports/baseball/yankees-cap-sweep-with-speed-not-slugging.html', 'snippet': 'In extending a 16-game home winning streak against Toronto, the Yankees relied on the baserunning abilities of Jacoby Ellsbury, Brian Roberts and Brett Gardner, all of whom helped manufacture runs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are nights when the Yankees, long known for their power hitting, look meek at the plate and must find ways other than the long ball to score runs. The off-season additions of Jacoby Ellsbury and Brian Roberts to complement Brett Gardner have made these Yankees, uncharacteristically, more runners than bombers. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/sports/CITY-YANKS/CITY-YANKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/20/sports/CITY-YANKS/CITY-YANKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/sports/CITY-YANKS/CITY-YANKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/sports/CITY-YANKS/CITY-YANKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/sports/CITY-YANKS/CITY-YANKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard