any to self itself “immediately.” He also demanded that three of his representatives be added to Family Dollar’s board. If the company does not cooperate, Mr. Icahn said he plans to go directly to shareholders with an effort to throw out the entire board.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Agenda: Icahn Takes Aim at Family Dollar', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T11:27:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/24d6d370-46b7-5d94-9bd7-83fd1bdfdefa', 'word_count': 2045, 'uri': 'nyt://article/24d6d370-46b7-5d94-9bd7-83fd1bdfdefa'}, {'abstract': 'The government forces were carrying out searches and arrests in a campaign to find three Israeli youths abducted a week ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/21/world/middleeast/israeli-troops-kill-palestinian-teenager-protesting-west-bank-arrests.html', 'snippet': 'The government forces were carrying out searches and arrests in a campaign to find three Israeli youths abducted a week ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — Israeli troops killed a Palestinian youth before dawn Friday and seriously wounded several adults as their sweeping West Bank arrest campaign following last week’s disappearance of three Israeli teenagers both slowed and encountered more resistance. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israeli Troops Kill Palestinian Teenager Protesting Arrests in the West Bank', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israeli Troops