bject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Charney, Dov', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN APPAREL', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T12:53:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vanessa Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vanessa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29fe7d6d-3801-536e-b0c8-8704237c86a4', 'word_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29fe7d6d-3801-536e-b0c8-8704237c86a4'}, {'abstract': 'The emotive half-French, half-Mexican balladeer puts 20 years of musical training to use on her debut EP.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/20/andrea-balency-electronica-this-wall-song-premiere/', 'snippet': 'The emotive half-French, half-Mexican balladeer puts 20 years of musical training to use on her debut EP.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The singer and producer Andrea Balency takes an unconventional tact when it comes to making electronic music. Rather than adding to what has become the echo chamber of EDM (electronic dance music), Balency’s ethereal voice and soft structures instead aim to mimic the movements of contemporary dance. “I’ve always loved dancing,” she says. “Those movements are something I try to translate with music.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20balency-oloizia/20balency-oloizia-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20balency-oloizia/20balency-oloizia-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20balency-oloizia/20balency-oloizia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20balency-oloizia/20balency-oloizia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20balency-oloizia/20balency-oloizia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20balency-oloizia/20balency-oloizia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/t-magazine/20balency-oloizia/20balency-oloizia-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Listen Up | Andrea Balency Takes the Long Road to Electronica', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Red Bull Music Academy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T13:00:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily McDermott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McDermott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fee64dbc-68dd-572c-872c-469948715aa8', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fee64dbc-68dd-572c-872c-469948715aa8'}, {'abstract': 'A State Department report released Friday ranks the two Southeast Asian countries with North Korea, Iran and Zimbabwe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/21/world/asia/us-gives-thailand-and-malaysia-lowest-grade-on-human-trafficking.html', 'snippet': 'A State Department report released Friday ranks the two Southeast Asian countries with North Korea, Iran and Zimbabwe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — Thailand and Malaysia are among the two dozen countries doing the least to fight human trafficking, according to a State Department report released Friday, a finding that could lead to economic and diplomatic penalties.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Gives Thailand and Malaysia Lowest Grade on Human Trafficking', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Trafficking Report Faults Thailand and Malaysia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Trafficking', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Malaysia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thailand', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T13:01:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Moll', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moll', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/09d3e32d-6e3f-52b0-9a51-0ea754609093', 'word_count': 778, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09d3e32d-6e3f-52b0-9a51-0ea754609093'}, {'abstract': 'The trickster character has seen better days. As the documentary “The Internet’s Own Boy” demonstrates, it’s not always possible to think of the high-tech incarnation of this type as a folk hero.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/22/movies/in-internets-own-boy-and-beyond-hackers-on-screen.html', 'snippet': 'The trickster character has seen better days. As the documentary “The Internet’s Own Boy” demonstrates, it’s not always possible to think of the high-tech incarnation of this type as a folk hero.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Woe to the once-hallowed trickster. In ancient mythologies, the riddler-thief and agent of change held a position of prestige. Now, we don’t know what to do with him. In our two Americas, we do black and white, either/or, with us or against us. The trickster is in between, both and neither, a character on the fringes. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/arts/22TRICKSTER3/22TRICKSTER3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/22/arts/22TRICKSTER3/22TRICKSTER3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/arts/22TRICKSTER3/22TRICKSTER3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/arts/22TRICKSTER3/22TRICKSTER3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cre