, but I was too young to make sense of them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I had never been to Mexico before. It was the summer after eighth grade, and my best friend’s parents invited me to their condo in the Yucatán Peninsula, about an hour by car from Cancun. My mother dropped me at Newark Airport. She told me to behave.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '50', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22lives/mag-22Lives-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22lives/mag-22Lives-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22lives/mag-22Lives-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 711, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22lives/mag-22Lives-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1422, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22lives/mag-22Lives-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22lives/mag-22Lives-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22lives/mag-22Lives-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What I Didn’t Understand That Summer in Mexico', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sea Changes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Parish, Stan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Divorce, Separations and Annulments', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T14:37:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stan Parish', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parish', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b3c8b736-6e73-55e6-ba69-e8df4a8293d8', 'word_count': 829, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b3c8b736-6e73-55e6-ba69-e8df4a8293d8'}, {'abstract': 'Gail Caldwell revisits a turning point in her life, one that opened up a world of new possibilities and connections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/22/books/review/new-life-no-instructions-by-gail-caldwell.html', 'snippet': 'Gail Caldwell revisits a turning point in her life, one that opened up a world of new possibilities and connections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the cusp of turning 50, the artist Tracey Emin told the BBC: “I always thought that love was about desire, being with someone, holding someone, feeling someone. But it isn’t necessarily. Love can be different and come in lots of different ways and lots of different guises.” Her interviewer was suitably intrigued. England’s notorious “bad girl” no longer cared about shagging.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 