', 'middlename': 'Rubiner', 'lastname': 'Zinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/90de706d-2e28-5af4-98d0-b69c9f8ed107', 'word_count': 781, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90de706d-2e28-5af4-98d0-b69c9f8ed107'}, {'abstract': 'In Red Hook, Brooklyn, the actor Michael Shannon and his family find a middle ground between the city and suburbs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/22/realestate/michael-shannons-red-hook-brooklyn-loft-rental.html', 'snippet': 'In Red Hook, Brooklyn, the actor Michael Shannon and his family find a middle ground between the city and suburbs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Throughout history men have made quixotic and impressive sacrifices for the women they loved — started wars, committed murder, swallowed poison, abdicated. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Michael Shannon Finds Balance on the Waterfront', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Finding Balance on the Waterfront', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shannon, Michael', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Red Hook (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T15:35:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanne Kaufman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaufman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b942febe-dc21-5f16-8b0f-b1bfe5e2adec', 'word_count': 1091, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b942febe-dc21-5f16-8b0f-b1bfe5e2adec'}, {'abstract': 'Times critics on “Venus in Fur,” “Norte, the End of History” and “Jersey Boys.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/20/video-reviews-of-venus-in-fur-norte-the-end-of-history-and-jersey-boys/', 'snippet': 'Times critics on “Venus in Fur,” “Norte, the End of History” and “Jersey Boys.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this week’s video, Times critics review “Venus in Fur,” “Norte, the End of History” and “Jersey Boys.” See all of this week’s reviews.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Reviews of ‘Venus in Fur,’ ‘Norte, the End of History’ and ‘Jersey Boys’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T15:38:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5495bfcd-83cf-5143-9a3e-872064958e91', 'word_count': 24, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5495bfcd-83cf-5143-9a3e-872064958e91'}, {'abstract': 'The comedian who was badly injured in a crash earlier this month was released from the hospital.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/20/tracy-morgan-is-moved-to-rehab-center/', 'snippet': 'The comedian who was badly injured in a crash earlier this month was released from the hospital.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tracy Morgan was released from the New Jersey hospital where he was being treated for critical injuries from a car accident and “transferred to an undisclosed rehab center,” his press representatives said Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tracy Morgan Is Moved to Rehab Center', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morgan, Tracy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T15:49:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2f4660b-86fb-5367-87de-b9056932498e', 'word_count': 169, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2f4660b-86fb-5367-87de-b9056932498e'}, {'abstract': 'Broccoli stems often play second fiddle to the more popular crowns, and are sometimes even shunned altogether. That’s a shame, because stems have a charm all their own. These recipes highlight the differences in texture and flavor of two parts of the same vegetable.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/20/broccoli-stems-and-all/', 'snippet': 'Broccoli stems often play second fiddle to the more popular crowns, and are sometimes even shunned altogether. That’s a shame, because stems have a charm all their own. These recipes highlight the differences in texture and flavor of two parts of ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Once upon a time, when you bought broccoli you bought the whole vegetable, stems and crowns. Then it became customary for grocery store produce departments to separate the crowns from the stems and to sell the crowns at a premium. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/17/science/recipehealthpromo/recipehealthpromo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/17/science/recipehealthpromo/recipehealthpromo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype':