terial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc2fc1d9-dfce-50fa-ab9f-16139ada25e9', 'word_count': 391, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc2fc1d9-dfce-50fa-ab9f-16139ada25e9'}, {'abstract': 'A new slate of less-than-perfect women have taken TV and film by storm, and, ANNA NORTH writes, some critics are happier about it than others.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/20/tvs-messy-women/', 'snippet': 'A new slate of less-than-perfect women have taken TV and film by storm, and, ANNA NORTH writes, some critics are happier about it than others.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Trainwreck.” “Burnout.” “Poster child for IDGAF.” Whatever you call her, a new female archetype has made its way to film and TV, and some viewers are more excited than others.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/opinion/nyto-broads/nyto-broads-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 593, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/20/opinion/nyto-broads/nyto-broads-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 593}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/opinion/nyto-broads/nyto-broads-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1013, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/opinion/nyto-broads/nyto-broads-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1639, 'width': 1657, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/20/opinion/nyto-broads/nyto-broads-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/20/opinion/nyto-broads/nyto-broads-thumbStanda