2370328b-edae-5e8a-8fe7-8461da9c5df6'}, {'abstract': 'On “Frankenfood,” which begins on Sunday on Spike, judges size up hybrid dishes invented by amateur cooks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/21/arts/television/frankenfood-a-cooking-contest-on-spike-tv.html', 'snippet': 'On “Frankenfood,” which begins on Sunday on Spike, judges size up hybrid dishes invented by amateur cooks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A certain barbecued blandness can infest food programs at this time of year. “Frankenfood,” a spunky series that begins on Sunday night on Spike, puts variety back on the plate, with ridiculous, sometimes gag-inducing results.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Odd and Original, Yes. Appetizing? Maybe Not.', 'kicker': 'Television Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Odd and Original, Yes. Appetizing? Maybe Not.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Frankenfood (TV Program)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Spike TV', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T19:35:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Genzlinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Genzlinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/35c887c7-5e8d-51e9-88fd-56b36159c744', 'word_count': 243, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35c887c7-5e8d-51e9-88fd-56b36159c744'}, {'abstract': 'Representative Don Young was required to pay a fine of almost $60,000 for using campaign money for personal purposes and for accepting “impermissible gifts.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/21/us/politic