a bill outlawing the sale of virtually all items with more than small amounts of elephant ivory or rhinoceros horn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the chagrin of New York antiques dealers, lawmakers in Albany have voted to outlaw the sale of virtually all items containing more than small amounts of elephant ivory, mammoth ivory or rhinoceros horn. The legislation, which is backed by Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo, will essentially eliminate New York’s central role in a well-established, nationwide trade with an estimated annual value of $500 million.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Law to Impose Tough Limits on Sales of Ivory Art', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Law to Impose Tough Limits on Sales of Ivory Art', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mashberg, Tom', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ivory', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elephants', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rhinoceroses', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poaching (Wildlife)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-20T21:17:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Mashberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mashberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'New