imes.com/2014/06/20/under-cover-a-boomerang-kid-documents-his-generation/', 'snippet': 'The June 22 cover story about “boomerang kids” features photographs taken by Damon Casarez, who graduated from the Art Center College of Design in Pasadena, Calif., with $120,000 in student debt. He recently discussed how his circumstances influen...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The June 22 cover story about “boomerang kids” features photographs taken by Damon Casarez, who graduated from the Art Center College of Design in Pasadena, Calif., with $120,000 in student debt. Eventually, his loan payments became unmanageable, and he moved in with his parents. The discomfort of sleeping on the living-room couch and readjusting to his parents’ house rules inspired Casarez to reach out to others like him. “I did this project because it was something that I knew and something that I thought needed to be talked about,” Casarez says. He recently discussed how his circumstances influenced his portrait-taking.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22Cover_text/22Cover_text-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 730, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22Cover_text/22Cover_text-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 730}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22Cover_text/22Cover_text-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 843, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/magazine/22Cover_text/22Cover_text-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1685, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':