 advisers to Iraq to aid them in resisting Sunni militants. Lawmakers will weigh in on the president’s foreign policy decisions on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/21/sunday-breakfast-menu-june-22/', 'snippet': 'President Obama announced this week that he would send 300 military advisers to Iraq to aid them in resisting Sunni militants. Lawmakers will weigh in on the president’s foreign policy decisions on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As unrest and violence continues in Iraq, President Obama announced Thursday that he would send 300 military advisers to the country to aid struggling security forces to fight off Sunni militants. Insurgents with the Sunni militant group Islamic State in Iraq and Syria have swept through northern cities, often seizing money from banks along the way.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunday Breakfast Menu, June 22', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-21T18:57:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elena Schneider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schneider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/895939c5-8d83-5b42-9615-61c9509759ec', 'word_count': 497, 'uri': 'nyt://article/895939c5-8d83-5b42-9615-61c9509759ec'}, {'abstract': 'Journalists from Mexico seeking asylum in the United States enter a bureaucratic nightmare.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/22/opinion/sunday/exiled-mexican-journalists-face-red-tape-and-doubt-in-us.html', 'snippet': 'Journalists from Mexico seeking asylum in the United States enter a bureaucratic nightmare.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ON June 20, 2011, in Veracruz, Mexico, Miguel Ángel López Solana arrived home to find that his brother, mother and father had been murdered. Both sons were photojournalists at the newspaper where their father was a columnist, writing about crime and political corruption. Within a month, another journalist at the paper was decapitated. A year later, four more journalists were murdered there in a single week. It’s not clear why they were killed, but Mr. López wasn’t going to wait around to find out. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/sunday-review/0622ASYLUM01/0622ASYLUM01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/22/sunday-review/0622ASYLUM01/0622ASYLUM01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/sunday-review/0622ASYLUM01/0622ASYLUM01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/sunday-review/0622ASYLUM01/0622ASYLUM01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1330, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/sunday-review/0622ASYLUM01/0622ASYLUM01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/22/sunday-review/0622ASYLUM01/0622ASYLUM01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/22/sunday-rev