14.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/23/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-monday-june-23-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Monday, June 23, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I would like to see a settlement. I was out of work. I missed so much of my son’s developmental growth while I was in the hospital. I had to have my face reconstructed. And my leg just hurts.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Monday, June 23, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-23T03:29:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b2932a9-5ffc-53fc-8548-ed6266a53e30', 'word_count': 54, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b2932a9-5ffc-53fc-8548-ed6266a53e30'}, {'abstract': 'The preliminary reading of a purchasing managers’ index for June rose to 50.8 points from a reading of 49.4 in May, and beating a forecast of 49.7.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/business/international/china-manufacturing-hits-7-month-high.html', 'snippet': 'The preliminary reading of a purchasing managers’ index for June rose to 50.8 points from a reading of 49.4 in May, and beating a forecast of 49.7.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — China’s manufacturing sector rebounded in June, showing signs of growth for the first time this year, according to a purchasing managers’ index released on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China Manufacturing Hits 7-Month High', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subje