'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a781dba-24ff-5461-836a-d98782362884', 'word_count': 661, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a781dba-24ff-5461-836a-d98782362884'}, {'abstract': 'In Baghdad, Secretary of State John Kerry said the United States might not be able to wait for Iraqi politicians to form a new government before taking military action.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/world/middleeast/kerry-in-baghdad-to-urge-iraqis-to-form-new-inclusive-government.html', 'snippet': 'In Baghdad, Secretary of State John Kerry said the United States might not be able to wait for Iraqi politicians to form a new government before taking military action.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD — Winding up a day of crisis talks with Iraqi leaders, Secretary of State John Kerry said on Monday that the Sunni militants seizing territory in Iraq had become such a threat that the United States might not wait for Iraqi politicians to form a new government before taking military action.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/23/world/middleeast/24KERRY/24KERRY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/23/world/middleeast/24KERRY/24KERRY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 439}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/23/world/middleeast/24KERRY/24KERRY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 749, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/23/world/middleeast/24KERRY/24KERRY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1498, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption'