 DealBook. Alstom’s board said on Saturday that it had unanimously backed G.E.’s offer, contingent on the French state buying Alstom shares. On Friday, France’s economy minister, Arnaud Montebourg, blessed G.E.’s bid over a rival offer from Siemens and Mitsubishi Heavy Industries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Agenda: Path Clear for G.E.’s Alstom Deal', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-23T12:05:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/161cb8da-ca87-5c79-99c2-3d3c6ffb8fab', 'word_count': 1964, 'uri': 'nyt://article/161cb8da-ca87-5c79-99c2-3d3c6ffb8fab'}, {'abstract': 'Milan', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/06/23/fashion/runway-mens/gucci-spring-2015-menswear.html', 'snippet': 'Milan', 'lead_paragraph': 'Milan', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/23/fashion/runway-mens/gucci-mens-slide-A5D1/gucci-mens-slide-A5D1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/23/fashion/runway-mens/gucci-mens-slide-A5D1/gucci-mens-slide-A5D1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/23/fashion/runway-mens/gucci-mens-slide-A5D1/gucci-mens-slide-A5D1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank':