', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/23/may-i-mash-your-peas-and-adjust-your-bib-sir/', 'snippet': 'The rise of family travel meets the trend of homemade baby food at a number of resorts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Forget packing those small jars. The rise of family travel meets the\xa0trend of homemade baby food\xa0at a number of resorts, many of them in foreign destinations where parents may worry about food safety.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'May I Mash Your Peas and Adjust Your Bib, Sir?', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baby Foods', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-23T14:44:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elaine Glusac', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elaine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glusac', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0917f68-5ac1-514b-9d28-ee81b79eb229', 'word_count': 324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0917f68-5ac1-514b-9d28-ee81b79eb229'}, {'abstract': 'An investigation determined there was no evidence that Gov. Tom Corbett tried to slow the Jerry Sandusky sexual-abuse case at Penn State for political purposes as he ran for the office.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/sports/ncaafootball/report-says-pennsylvania-governor-did-not-drag-feet-in-sandusky-case.html', 'snippet': 'An investigation determined there was no evidence that Gov. Tom Corbett tried to slow the Jerry Sandusky sexual-abuse case at Penn State for political purposes as he ran for the office.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HARRISBURG, Pa. — Gov. Tom Corbett of Pennsylvania may have taken longer than he should have to investigate claims of sexual abuse by the former Penn State football assistant Jerry Sandusky, but there was no evidence that he tried to slow the case for political purposes as he ran for the state’s highest office, according to a report released Monday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Inquiry Finds No Political Pacing of Sandusky Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inquiry Finds No Political Pacing of Sandusky Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tracy, Marc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania State University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Second Mile', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corbett, Thomas W', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sandusky, Jerry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-23T14:44:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marc Tracy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marc', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tracy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b55c1f0-c0f0-5334-a8d6-7d6dcc7e3174', 'word_count': 830, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b55c1f0-c0f0-5334-a8d6-7d6dcc7e3174'}, {'abstract': 'The National Trust for Historic Preservation released its 2014 list of endangered places and included the only home in Florida designed by Frank Lloyd Wright.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/23/preservation-trust-lists-palisades-wright-home-and-slave-ship-as-endangered/', 'snippet': 'The National Trust for Historic Preservation released its 2014 list of endangered places and included the only home in Florida designed by Frank Lloyd Wright.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Palisades in Englewood Cliffs, N.J., whose vista is threatened by a proposed office tower; the only private home designed by Frank Lloyd Wright in Florida; and a Virginia slave trading center that includes remnants of the jail that held Solomon Northup — of “12 Years a Slave” – are among the country’s most endangered historic places, according to the National Trust for Historic Preservation’s 2014 list, which was released Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Preservation Trust Lists Palisades, Wright Home and Remnant of the Slave Trade as Endangered', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Historic Buildings and Sites', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Northup, Solomon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wright, Frank Lloyd', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Trust for Historic Preservation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cincinnati (Ohio)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Englewood Cliffs (NJ)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-23T15:00:30+0000', 'd