ralia.', 'web_url': 'https://sports.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/23/australia-vs-spain-world-cup-2014-live-blog/', 'snippet': 'Spain makes its early exit from the 2014 World Cup with three beautiful goals in its last match, a 3-0 defeat of Australia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This game is likely to be the valedictory for many of Spain’s older stars, who have won two European championships and a World Cup. Expect Australia, which has punched above its weight at this tournament, to give a good account of itself again. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Australia vs. Spain: World Cup 2014 Live Blog', 'kicker': 'Sports', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup 2014 (Soccer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-23T15:16:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63ddcf77-8041-5315-9b21-c7640d14919b', 'word_count': 2615, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63ddcf77-8041-5315-9b21-c7640d14919b'}, {'abstract': 'Thad Cochran and Chris McDaniel continued to make their case to Mississippi voters as part of their closing arguments before Tuesday’s runoff election.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/us/politics/thad-cochran-and-chris-mcdaniel-make-closing-arguments.html', 'snippet': 'Thad Cochran and Chris McDaniel continued to make their case to Mississippi voters as part of their closing arguments before Tuesday’s runoff