m she described as “my black kingdom come,” went to the bathroom, Ms. Angelou thought he had been taken away by a porter. “It scared me to death,” she recounted in a video interview recorded in 2010. “I wasn’t afraid that my mother wouldn’t come back or my father or anyone else. It was always Bailey.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Library of Congress to Display Interviews With Blacks, Noted and Unsung ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Library of Congress to Display Interviews With Blacks, Noted and Unsung', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vega, Tanzina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Archives and Records', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Library of Congress', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-23T20:23:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tanzina Vega', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tanzina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vega', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43571078-8610-58eb-9bdb-3671cbf16e06', 'word_count': 986, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43571078-8610-58eb-9bdb-3671cbf16e06'}, {'abstract': 'JetBlue’s new premium service between New York and Los Angeles, called Mint, is a departure from its egalitarian image.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/business/jetblue-adds-flat-bed-seats-on-cross-country-flights.html', 'snippet': 'JetBlue’s new premium service between New York and Los Angeles, call