], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/fec2b1d3-5d7a-557a-a800-3de1a51d39db', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/fec2b1d3-5d7a-557a-a800-3de1a51d39db'}, {'abstract': 'The weeklong Early Music Festival: NYC showed that the city has the potential to catch up to Boston and San Francisco.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/arts/music/early-music-and-its-future.html', 'snippet': 'The weeklong Early Music Festival: NYC showed that the city has the potential to catch up to Boston and San Francisco.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new Early Music Festival: NYC, which ended last week, gives reason for cautious hope. You can’t be categorical about its prospects one way or the other, because several more or less similar ventures have come and gone in recent years.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/arts/24EARLY/24EARLY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 424, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/24/arts/24EARLY/24EARLY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 424}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/arts/24EARLY/24EARLY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/arts/24EARLY/24EARLY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1447, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/arts/24EARLY/24EARLY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'t