Iraqi Law for U.S. Advisory Troops', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Diplomatic Note Promises Immunity From Iraqi Law for U.S. Advisory Troops', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baker, Peter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Immunity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-23T22:35:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d57dff4e-275c-5f1f-9997-e06a4360b595', 'word_count': 746, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d57dff4e-275c-5f1f-9997-e06a4360b595'}, {'abstract': 'New research says that both oral and genital herpes have been infecting humans and our ancestors for longer than previously thought.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/health/herpes-infected-since-before-we-were-human.html', 'snippet': 'New research says that both oral and genital herpes have been infecting humans and our ancestors for longer than previously thought.', 'lead_paragraph': 'About two-thirds of people are infected with one of two herpes simplex viruses, oral (HSV-1) or genital (HSV-2). New research says both viruses have been infecting humans and our ancestors for longer than previously thought. HSV-1 has been infecting hominids since before they split from the chimpanzee lineage six million years ago, a new study says. HSV-2 was introduced more recently, the researchers said, making the jump from chimpanzees to human ancestors about 1.6 million years ago.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Herpes Infected ‘Since Before We Were Human’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Biology: Herpes Infected ‘Since Before We Were Human’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Herpes Viruses', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quenqua, Douglas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Monkeys and Apes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTHROPOLOGY', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Molecular Biology and Evolution (Journal)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wertheim, Joel O', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-23T22:36:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Quenqua', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Quenqua', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f120c3e-5be6-5672-a80a-2d89b472b026', 'word_count': 254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f120c3e-5be6-5672-a80a-2d89b472b026'}, {'abstract': 'Brazil, which has not played with the precision and dominance that many had hoped for, nevertheless moved on to the next round with a convincing win.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/sports/worldcup/world-cup-2014-2-neymar-goals-carry-brazil-past-cameroon.html', 'snippet': 'Brazil, which has not played with the precision and dominance that many had hoped for, nevertheless moved on to the next round with a convincing win.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRASÍLIA — An anxious n