 in each episode; challenges focus on technology, interiors, body trim and functionality. Each round will be judged by Jean Jennings, former editor in chief of Automobile Magazine; the car designer Harald Belker; and a celebrity, with designers eliminated one by one until only two remain for the final build-off. The winner will receive a 2014 Camaro Z28 and $100,000, and be named a brand ambassador for General Motors. Brooke Burns (above, far left, with Ms. Jennings and Mr. Belker) hosts; Jesse Metcalfe is the guest judge in this series premiere.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On Tuesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Tuesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-24T05:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/d7e6f91e-9e0c-5a0d-8b40-b37b57a7548e', 'word_count': 750, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d7e6f91e-9e0c-5a0d-8b40-b37b57a7548e'}, {'abstract': 'The H7N9 strain of avian influenza poses a threat to several other parts of Asia, including the Philippines, Indonesia, Vietnam, Bangladesh and India, according to a new study.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/mapping-the-risk-of-bird-flus-spread/', 'snippet': 'The H7N9 strain of avian influenza poses a threat to several other parts of Asia, including the Philippines, Indonesia, Vietnam, Bangladesh and India, according to a new study.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A strain of bird flu that has infected at least 367 people in mainland China over the past year poses a threat to 