ite, and striker Joel Campbell has emerged as a breakout star.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Costa Rica conquered mighty Uruguay and Italy and is on course to win this Group of Death. Its joyous play has made it many fans’ new favorite, and striker Joel Campbell has emerged as a breakout star. By contrast, England’s fans are morose. The team has not been flat out horrible, but is 0-2 and out of the Cup. Wayne Rooney and company will want a win to salvage some pride. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Costa Rica vs. England: World Cup 2014 Live Blog', 'kicker': 'Sports', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup 2014 (Soccer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Costa Rica', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'England', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-24T14:01:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Duncan Irving', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Duncan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Irving', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/630110f2-5dc9-5d17-aad8-9b8cc6a17259', 'word_count': 1834, 'uri': 'nyt://article/630110f2-5dc9-5d17-aad8-9b8cc6a17259'}, {'abstract': 'Milan', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/06/24/fashion/runway-mens/roberto-cavalli-spring-2015-menswear.html', 'snippet': 'Milan', 'lead_paragraph': 'Milan', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/fashion/runway-mens/robertocavalli-mens-slide-76SP/robertocavalli-mens-slide-76SP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType'