'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8d7f1fb-868f-59b2-98ac-0abb2c7d6b7d', 'word_count': 1, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8d7f1fb-868f-59b2-98ac-0abb2c7d6b7d'}, {'abstract': 'The move will allow LeBron James to explore opportunities with other teams and puts leverage on the Heat to improve their roster.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/sports/basketball/lebron-james-opting-out-of-miami-heat-contract.html', 'snippet': 'The move will allow LeBron James to explore opportunities with other teams and puts leverage on the Heat to improve their roster.', 'lead_paragraph': "Carmelo Anthony enjoyed the unique privilege of being the N.B.A.'s most coveted free agent for a little more than 36 hours. That ended Tuesday morning when it was revealed that LeBron James had informed the Miami Heat through his agent, Rich Paul, that he intended to exercise the early termination option on his contract and become a free agent July 1.", 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/sports/25nba/25nba-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/25/sports/25nba/25nba-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/sports/25nba/25nba-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 730, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/sports/25nba/25nba-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1461, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/sports/25nba/25nba-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/25/sports/25nba/25nba-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/sports/25nba/25nba-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Free-Agent Axis Tilts From Anthony to James', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Free-Agent Axis Tilts From Anthony to James', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANTHONY, CARMELO', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-24T16:42:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Cacciola', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cacciola', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a318f8fe-238a-584c-b91b-8aad1e84764c', 'word_count': 1016, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a318f8fe-238a-584c-b91b-8aad1e84764c'}, {'abstract': 'In “The Most Dangerous Book: The Battle for James Joyce’s ‘Ulysses,’ ” Kevin Birmingham explores censorship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/books/kevin-birminghams-book-on-ulysses-and-censorship.html', 'snippet': 'In “The Most Dangerous Book: The Battle for James Joyce’s ‘Ulysses,’ ” Kevin Birmingham explores censorship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kevin Birmingham’s new book about the long censorship fight over James Joyce’s “Ulysses” braids eight or nine good stories into one mighty strand. It’s about women’s rights and heroic female editors, about World War I, about anarchism and modernism, about tenderness and syphilis, about how literature can bend an era’s consciousness, about moral panic and about the Lost Generation and the tent it pitched at Sylvia Beach’s Paris bookstore. It isolates a great love story, that of Joyce and Nora Barnacle, one that comes with a finger-burning side order of some of the most cheerfully filthy correspondence in literary history.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/BIRMINGHAM1/BIRMINGHAM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 842, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/BIRMINGHAM1/BIRMINGHAM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 842}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/BIRMINGHAM1/BIRMINGHAM1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 730, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/BIRMINGHAM1/BIRMINGHAM1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1460, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/BIRMINGHAM1/BIRMINGHAM1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/BIRMINGHAM1/BIRMINGHAM1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'im