)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-24T19:01:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pete Wells', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pete', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wells', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/2658952e-cfed-51f4-8293-9b2685499dce', 'word_count': 1191, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2658952e-cfed-51f4-8293-9b2685499dce'}, {'abstract': 'Like many Western Hemisphere nations, Colombia has had a strong start to the Cup. Expect Juan Cuadrado to send in dangerous crosses that bother Japan’s defense.', 'web_url': 'https://sports.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/24/columbia-vs-japan-world-cup-2014-live-blog/', 'snippet': 'Like many Western Hemisphere nations, Colombia has had a strong start to the Cup. Expect Juan Cuadrado to send in dangerous crosses that bother Japan’s defense.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like many Western Hemisphere nations, Colombia has had a strong start to the Cup. Expect Juan Cuadrado to send in dangerous crosses that bother Japan’s defense. Japan has just one goal at the Cup and could only draw woeful Greece. This will be a tough spot. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Colombia vs. Japan: World Cup 2014 Live Blog', 'kicker': 'Sports', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup 2014 (Soccer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colombia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations',