easures of Being Out of Step” is a documentary about the music critic and First Amendment defender Nat Hentoff.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/movies/the-pleasures-of-being-out-of-step-about-nat-hentoff.html', 'snippet': '“The Pleasures of Being Out of Step” is a documentary about the music critic and First Amendment defender Nat Hentoff.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The Pleasures of Being Out of Step: Notes on the Life of Nat Hentoff” is very much in step with the enthusiasms of its nobly bearded 89-year-old subject, the critic Nat Hentoff. The director David L. Lewis presents a man who’s all about the voice — letting it sing, as in the instrumental improvisations of the jazz he loves, and keeping it alive, through his dogmatic defense of the First Amendment.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/pleasures/pleasures-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/pleasures/pleasures-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 363}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/pleasures/pleasures-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 619, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/pleasures/pleasures-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1199, 'width': 1982, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/arts/pleasures/pleasures-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/25/art