st two weeks — any city street, really, in any city — there’s a good chance you passed someone (or, indeed, many someones) wearing, say, a lurid yellow shirt trimmed in green, or a slightly twee white polo-neck edged in blue, or a blood-red tee with black stripes. And then you, like me, may have scratched your head and thought, “Where are they getting their fashion cues from?”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The World Cup Winners', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The World Cup Winners', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uniforms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup 2014 (Soccer)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ADIDAS AG', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NIKE Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "United States Men's National Soccer Team", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup (Soccer)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-24T22:25:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vanessa Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vanessa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c60e962-4124-5739-ba10-d0c5743382c2', 'word_count': 1030, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c60e962-4124-5739-ba10-d0c5743382c2'}, {'abstract': 'The redesigned Edge has many standard safety features and an optional 2-liter turbocharged EcoBoost 4-cylinder engine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/automob