fcc1c8e8-e1d8-508e-953f-a8d00c939ae0', 'word_count': 759, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fcc1c8e8-e1d8-508e-953f-a8d00c939ae0'}, {'abstract': 'In this exclusive video, T tours “Hy-Fi,” a new structure in the Long Island City, Queens museum’s courtyard built with bricks comprised of shredded corn stalks and fungus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/t-magazine/moma-young-architects-program.html', 'snippet': 'In this exclusive video, T tours “Hy-Fi,” a new structure in the Long Island City, Queens museum’s courtyard built with bricks comprised of shredded corn stalks and fungus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each year, the Museum of Modern Art and MoMA PS1 co-sponsor of the Young Architects Program — a contest in which emerging talents compete for the chance to build a temporary structure in PS1’s courtyard in Long Island City. The projects remain on-site for the duration of each summer, providing both shade and interactivity for PS1 visitors and attendees of the museum’s popular “Warm Up” outdoor concert series.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tour a New Building Made of Corn and Mushrooms at MoMA PS1', 'kicker': 'By Design', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-25T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TDesign', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eviana Hartman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eviana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hartman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6ef3b5fa-4bd0-5477-9ea5-745366e682d9', 'word_count': 253, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6ef3b5fa-4bd0-5477-9ea5-745366e682d9'}, {'abstract': 'The new digital network, backed by Time Inc., is hoping to compete with networks like ESPN, using short clips and fast talking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/business/media/time-inc-to-start-120-sports-a-digital-network-with-pro-leagues.html', 'snippet': 'The new digital network, backed by Time Inc., is hoping to compete with networks like ESPN, using short clips and fast talking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s a sports network catering to the shortened attention spans of the mobile and social media generation: 240 clips, each two minutes long, across eight hours of daily programming. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Time Inc. to Start 120 Sports, a Digital Network, With Pro Leagues', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leagues Join Time Inc. in Digital Sports Network', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Athletics and Sports', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Time Inc.', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': '120Sports LLC', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-25T04:01:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Steel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Steel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dac8ac71-f195-5f0d-b096-6118e3f9928d', 'word_count': 1019, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dac8ac71-f195-5f0d-b096-6118e3f9928d'}, {'abstract': 'To realize the greatest benefits from exercise, we probably need to ramp up our workouts.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/for-fitness-push-yourself/', 'snippet': 'To realize the greatest benefits from exercise, we probably need to ram