GRY Gabi (Emily Osment), a sassy food blogger hoping to become the personal chef of Josh (Jonathan Sadowski, above with Ms. Osment), a wealthy tech entrepreneur, must prepare a romantic meal for him and his girlfriend as a test to get the job. But when the dinner goes awry, Gabi transforms the disaster into a chance not only for employment but maybe even love. Ashley Tisdale is an executive producer of this new series, inspired by the musings of Gabi Moskowitz, the San Francisco food blogger behind Brokeass Gourmet. Annie Potts, Kym Whitley, Rex Lee and Aimee Carrero round out the cast.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on Wednesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Wednesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-25T05:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/42b7ef3f-9b60-5f46-86f1-6af0c0dfc9fc', 'word_count': 706, 'uri': 'nyt://article/42b7ef3f-9b60-5f46-86f1-6af0c0dfc9fc'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, June 25, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-wednesday-june-25-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, June 25, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“This is a football World Cup, not about morality, cheap morality.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, June 25, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of 