', '_id': 'nyt://article/1d4b45d0-39fa-5dea-a39b-cba8a023b7b3', 'word_count': 178, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d4b45d0-39fa-5dea-a39b-cba8a023b7b3'}, {'abstract': 'Making an old standby delicious, with help from a celebrity chef.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/29/magazine/chicken-surprise.html', 'snippet': 'Making an old standby delicious, with help from a celebrity chef.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bobby Flay opened a new restaurant, Gato, a few months ago on Lafayette Street in Manhattan. Flay has been a celebrity for the better part of two decades. But he works in the open kitchen at Gato the way people do when they come to New York to make a name for themselves: head down, concentrating, hard. “It’s all I want to do now,” he said recently.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '44', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/magazine/29eat/29eat-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/29/magazine/29eat/29eat-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/magazine/29eat/29eat-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/magazine/29eat/29eat-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1047, 'width': 1568, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/magazine/29eat/29eat-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/29/magazine/29eat/29eat-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/magazine/29eat/29eat-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bobby Flay’s Chicken Surprise', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chicken Surprise', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sifton, Sam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chickens', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Flay, Bobby', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-25T09:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4da0f45e-34e3-5e63-9a0c-4f6afff19bbd', 'word_count': 720, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4da0f45e-34e3-5e63-9a0c-4f6afff19bbd'}, {'abstract': 'The young M.C. is on a quest to become the best rapper in the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/29/magazine/kendrick-lamar-hip-hops-newest-old-school-star.html', 'snippet': 'The young M.C. is on a quest to become the best rapper in the world.', 'lead_paragraph': '‘Everybody\xa0just wants to have fun, be with the scene,” Kendrick Lamar said when we met in his cramped quarters inside the Barclays Center in Brooklyn last fall. “Certain people get backstage, people that you would never expect. . . . You ain’t with the media! You ain’t into music! You ain’t into sports! You’re just here.” The rapper, now 27, had just finished his set as the opening act on this str