669a'}, {'abstract': 'The average financial adviser in the United States is older than 50. | A longtime managing director at Bain Capital is starting a new investment fund. | The law at the heart of the latest Christie inquiry. | The publisher Hachette has agreed to buy Perseus.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/morning-agenda-searching-for-young-financial-advisers/', 'snippet': 'The average financial adviser in the United States is older than 50. | A longtime managing director at Bain Capital is starting a new investment fund. | The law at the heart of the latest Christie inquiry. | The publisher Hachette has agreed to bu...', 'lead_paragraph': 'A HUNT FOR YOUNG FINANCIAL ADVISERS \xa0|\xa0 Wall Street has an aging problem. The average financial adviser in the United States is older than 50, a number that shows no sign of getting lower because relatively few young people are interested in the work, Rachel Abrams writes in DealBook. Now, as Wall Street turns more to asset management, it must figure out how to attract and retain a fresh pool of talent that is increasingly looking to find its riches elsewhere.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Agenda: Searching for Young Financial Advisers', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-25T13:29:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aeec26a4-203f-522a-a68c-712cb68423aa', 'word_count': 1989, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aeec26a4-203f-522a-a68c-712cb68423aa'}, {'abstract': 'The week before my two eldest children headed off for a month of open-air sleeping in the woods of northwest Virginia, I made a permethrin solution and soaked their clothes in it.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/my-yearly-camp-permethrin-dance/', 'snippet': 'The week before my two eldest children headed off for a month of open-air sleeping in the woods of northwest Virginia, I made a permethrin solution and soaked their clothes in it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The season of sleep-away camp is upon us, and in our house that means it’s time for the yearly pesticide ritual.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/us/motherlode-pink-gloves/motherlode-pink-gloves-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 320, 'width': 240, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/us/motherlode-pink-gloves/motherlode-pink-gloves-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 320, 'width': 240, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/us/motherlode-pink-gloves/motherlode-pink-gloves-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/24/us/motherlode-pink-gloves/motherlode-pink-gloves-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/us/motherlode-pink-gloves/motherlode-pink-gloves-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'My Yearly Camp Permethrin Dance', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'