ich prevents those suspected of terrorist ties from boarding flights in the United States or flying through American airspace, is reported to include more than 20,000 names—a number that metastasized after the Sept. 11 attacks. There’s a low evidentiary standard for getting on the list. Once on, it’s not only difficult to get off but almost impossible to find out why, exactly, one was added in the first place.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The No-Fly List Is Unconstitutional', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fifth Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Civil Liberties Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-25T15:22:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dorothy J. Samuels', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dorothy', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Samuels', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/71c203fd-852f-56e9-96bb-97a139e1eef6', 'word_count': 378, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71c203fd-852f-56e9-96bb-97a139e1eef6'}, {'abstract': 'This German soccer squad is not about to waltz to a cowardly draw with the Americans in their World Cup match on Thursday, even if it would suit both teams.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/26/sports/worldcup/germany-can-inflict-much-pain-on-us-as-it-has-before-world-cup-2014.html', 'snippet': 'This German soccer squad is not about to waltz to a cowardly draw with the Americans in their World Cup match on Thursday, even if it would suit both teams.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How can Germany make the United States suffer this time?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'mul