d needs a draw to be certain of winning the group. Ecuador’s situation is complex; with the right results it could advance even with a loss or be eliminated even with a win. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ecuador vs. France: World Cup 2014 Live Blog', 'kicker': 'Sports', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup 2014 (Soccer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ecuador', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-25T18:25:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lawrie Mifflin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lawrie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mifflin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/532113ba-31e1-56a5-b3c3-11134e25366e', 'word_count': 2432, 'uri': 'nyt://article/532113ba-31e1-56a5-b3c3-11134e25366e'}, {'abstract': 'It’s possible that three matches in the Round of 16 could be all-South American affairs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/26/upshot/argentinas-win-means-it-could-meet-ecuador-next.html', 'snippet': 'It’s possible that three matches in the Round of 16 could be all-South American affairs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The World Cup already features an entire portion of the Round of 16 bracket that’s dedicated to South America. It includes Brazil, Chile, Colombia and Uruguay and guarantees that one (and only one) of those four teams will reach the semifinals.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/upshot/26up-southamerica/26up-southameri