rtual reality in general and Oculus in particular until Facebook announced a $2 billion agreement to acquire Oculus.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/25/oculus-portrays-accuser-as-opportunist-in-lawsuit-over-virtual-reality-technology/', 'snippet': 'In a filing Wednesday in the Federal District Court in Dallas, Oculus said ZeniMax was largely indifferent to virtual reality in general and Oculus in particular until Facebook announced a $2 billion agreement to acquire Oculus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Oculus VR fired back at ZeniMax Media on Wednesday in its first formal response to accusations that it stole ZeniMax virtual reality technology. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/business/25bits-oculus/25bits-oculus-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 464, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/25/business/25bits-oculus/25bits-oculus-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 464}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/business/25bits-oculus/25bits-oculus-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 792, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/business/25bits-oculus/25bits-oculus-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1584, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/business/25bits-oculus/25bits-oculus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/25/business/25bits-oculus/25bits-oculus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75