ons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Milan, the best spring/summer 2015 men’s shows were true to the names behind them. Fashion houses celebrated their signature style with throwbacks to archival silhouettes and prints, while newer creative directors seamlessly incorporated their own visions into the DNA of the iconic brands they design for. These five collections represent refreshing new directions anchored in timeless design.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/t-magazine/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/25/t-magazine/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/t-magazine/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/t-magazine/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/25/t-magazine/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/25/t-magazine/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S/25milan-rider-slide-UT3S-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 