ael Egan, who had accused various Hollywood executives and filmmakers of sexual abuse, dropped a suit against Garth Ancier.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/26/business/media/michael-egan-was-suing-garth-ancier-for-statutory-rape.html', 'snippet': 'Lawyers for Michael Egan, who had accused various Hollywood executives and filmmakers of sexual abuse, dropped a suit against Garth Ancier.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Another of the sexual abuse lawsuits filed in Hawaii against various Hollywood executives and filmmakers by Michael Egan, this one against Garth Ancier, the longtime television executive, was voluntarily dismissed on Wednesday. Lawyers for Mr. Egan filed a brief notice of the dismissal with the United States District Court for the District of Hawaii. The dismissal was filed “without prejudice,” meaning that the claims of statutory rape and other abuse could be refiled.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Another of the Hollywood Sexual Abuse Suits Is Dropped', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANCIER, GARTH', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Egan, Michael', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Neuman, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hawaii', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hollywood (Calif)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-26T01:10:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cieply', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cieply', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'repo