', '_id': 'nyt://article/7af01eab-1010-5859-8798-139298a4348f', 'word_count': 1995, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7af01eab-1010-5859-8798-139298a4348f'}, {'abstract': 'As the adaptation “Dubliners: A Quartet” is presented this weekend, a writer ponders a paperback edition of “Dubliners” tied to his family history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/27/books/honoring-james-joyces-dubliners-published-100-years-ago.html', 'snippet': 'As the adaptation “Dubliners: A Quartet” is presented this weekend, a writer ponders a paperback edition of “Dubliners” tied to his family history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AFTER my Irish mother died, 15 years ago now, my siblings and I took eons to shake our paralysis of grief and deal with the physical things she left behind. When finally I mustered the energy, or courage, I found, to my surprise, a 1958 paperback edition of “Dubliners” in her night stand.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Singular Collection, Multiple Mysteries', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Singular Collection, Multiple Mysteries', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Dubliners (Book)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Joyce, James', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yorinks, Arthur', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Irish Arts Center', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-26T12:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Barry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': Non