 boycotted the game, concluded a day of few celebrations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRASÍLIA — The fact that 11 players from Ghana stepped onto the field to face Portugal at the appointed time was a victory in itself. After a week of infighting and boycott threats by its players, the Ghana Football Association on Thursday suspended two of its stars heading into the match, raising doubts about whether the team was equipped to play amid the turmoil.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/27ghanacup2/27ghanacup2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 446, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/27ghanacup2/27ghanacup2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 446}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/27ghanacup2/27ghanacup2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/27ghanacup2/27ghanacup2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1524, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/27ghanacup2/27ghanacup2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/27ghanacup2/27ghanacup2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/27ghanacup2/27ghanacup2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLa