uts and palatable price points. Now, in addition to its boutique in NoLIta, the brand is setting up shop in the neighborhood where many of its customers live and play: Williamsburg, Brooklyn. The new store opens tonight with a party at which Polachek herself will make an appearance in the D.J. booth. She plans on picking up a few things for her summer wardrobe, too. “I quite like their shorts, which is surprising since normally I’d never be caught dead in shorts,” she says. “The fit makes me feel like Laura Dern in ‘Jurassic Park,’ or a sexy-awkward ’70s camp counselor. In other words, totally ideal.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/t-magazine/26courtshop-hartman/26courtshop-hartman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/26/t-magazine/26courtshop-hartman/26courtshop-hartman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/t-magazine/26courtshop-hartman/26courtshop-hartman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/t-magazine/26courtshop-hartman/26courtshop-hartman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/t-magazine/26courtshop-hartman/26courtshop-hartman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/26/t-magazine/26courtshop-hartman/26courtshop-hartman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth'