.nytimes.com/2014/06/26/relational-said-to-plan-activist-campaign-against-manitowoc/', 'snippet': 'The activist investment firm plans to disclose that it has taken an 8.5 percent stake in the Manitowoc Company, with the aim of dividing the industrial company in two.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Relational Investors, the big activist investment firm, plans to push for the breakup of yet another company.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Relational Said to Plan Activist Campaign Against Manitowoc', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shareholder Rights and Activism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manitowoc Company Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Relational Investors LLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-26T20:12:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b899b93f-42cf-50c7-b73e-95e6db299885', 'word_count': 308, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b899b93f-42cf-50c7-b73e-95e6db299885'}, {'abstract': 'At just 22, the oustpoken, openly bisexual Canadian singer-songwriter (and former stripper) has a lifetime of material to draw from. Her new single, “I Love You Money,” debuts here.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/26/lowell-singer-songwriter-debuts-single-i-love-you-money/', 'snippet': 'At just 22, the oustpoken, openly bisexual Canadian singer-songwriter (and former stripper) has a lifetime of material to draw from. Her new single, “I Love You Money,” debuts here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eliza