pet': 'One of Libya’s most prominent civil rights activists, Salwa Bugaighis, was assassinated in her home in Benghazi on Wednesday, shortly after she posted an image of militiamen outside her home on Facebook.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just hours before she was assassinated on Wednesday, one of Libya’s most prominent civil rights activists, Salwa Bugaighis, logged on to Facebook to urge her fellow citizens of Benghazi to head to the polls and vote, despite violent clashes in the streets between Islamist militias and the forces of a renegade general.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Slain Libyan Rights Activist Documented Her Last Hours Online', 'kicker': 'News', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assassinations and Attempted Assassinations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's Rights", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bouckaert, Peter', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Benghazi (Libya)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Libya', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-26T23:37:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2fc58e4f-dd84-5c49-ac1e-5b1ccfd251bc', 'word_count': 360, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2fc58e4f-dd84-5c49-ac1e-5b1ccfd251bc'}, {'abstract': 'In “They Came Together,” the director David Wain goes after the romantic comedy genre with a metaphoric jackhammer and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/27/movies/paul-rudd-and-amy-poehler-star-in-they-came-together.html', 'snippet': 'In “They Came Together,” the director David Wain goes after the romantic comedy genre with a metaphoric jackhammer and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “They Came Together,” a sloppy, fitfully funny broadside at the romantic comedy, the director David Wain goes after that oft-abused genre with a metaphoric jackhammer — as well as a bat, a machete, a couple of knives, one or two missiles and the sort of sizzling cartoon bomb that Wile E. Coyote used to hurl. Mr. Wain has some expert help with his demolition work, namely his stars, Amy Poehler and Paul Rudd, who with another dozen or so cutups, embody assorted romantic comedy stereotypes with wide smiles, seasoned technique and unfettered spleen.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27THEYCAME/27THEYCAME-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27THEYCAME/27THEYCAME-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27THEYCAME/27THEYCAME-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27THEYCAME/27THEYCAME-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27THEYCAME/27THEYCAME-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 