a 74 in the first round of the Quicken Loans National. The leader, Greg Chalmers, posted a five-under 66.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BETHESDA, Md. — If it had been a band from the swing era, the Tiger Woods trio would have been booed off the stage Thursday at Congressional Country Club. But it was a golf group, and the crowd, which lined up five deep around the 10th tee and formed a human outline around the 208-yard par-3 hole, was overwhelmingly supportive from start to finish. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/CITY-GOLF/CITY-GOLF-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/CITY-GOLF/CITY-GOLF-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/CITY-GOLF/CITY-GOLF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/CITY-GOLF/CITY-GOLF-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1457, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/CITY-GOLF/CITY-GOLF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/CITY-GOLF/CITY-GOLF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/sports/CITY-GOLF/CITY-GOLF-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thu