umentary-about-the-gangster-whitey-bulger.html', 'snippet': 'The documentary “Whitey,” about the Boston gangster Whitey Bulger, tells of his murder case last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James J. Bulger, better known as Whitey, was a notorious and widely feared criminal in Boston in the 1970s and ’80s. He disappeared after being tipped off about an impending arrest in 1994, and after that was a famous fugitive. Captured three years ago in California — where he had been living quietly with his longtime girlfriend — Mr. Bulger was tried last summer on a host of charges, including 19 counts of murder. His trial is the subject of “Whitey,” a gripping and troubling new documentary by Joe Berlinger.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27WHITNEY/WHITNEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 476, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27WHITNEY/WHITNEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 476}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27WHITNEY/WHITNEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 812, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27WHITNEY/WHITNEY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1624, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27WHITNEY/27WHITNEY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/27/arts/27WHITNEY/27WHITNEY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 