'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e856e158-38c1-5ed7-a7ee-36789a028753', 'word_count': 917, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e856e158-38c1-5ed7-a7ee-36789a028753'}, {'abstract': 'Eighth graders, and the senior citizens they’ve been visiting all year, come together for an unexpectedly joyous celebration.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/27/an-education-of-the-heart-the-glenwood-towers-senior-center-prom/', 'snippet': 'Eighth graders, and the senior citizens they’ve been visiting all year, come together for an unexpectedly joyous celebration.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Can I have this dance?” a woman in a strapless black sundress said, offering her hand to my son. It was 93 degrees out on the patio at the senior center in downtown Raleigh, N.C. Aidan, dressed in his only suit and a striped tie, said, “of course.” I heard Esther counting the steps for him as she guided him into a waltz. One-two-three. One-two-three.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/us/motherlode-aiden-esther/motherlode-aiden-esther-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/24/us/motherlode-aiden-esther/motherlode-aiden-esther-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/us/motherlode-aiden-esther/motherlode-aiden-esther-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 622, 'width': 980, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/24/us/motherlode-aiden-esther/motherlode-aiden-esther-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 622, 'width': 980, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type