 'snippet': 'Richard Nixon and Pelé had a quick and awkward meeting in 1973. Nixon had something else on his mind: Watergate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday, May 8, 1973, at midday, Richard Nixon received the soccer star Pelé, member of the Brazilian team that won the World Cup championship of 1970. (In 1999, the International Olympic Committee voted Pelé “Athlete of the Century.” He is now 73 and retired.)', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/upshot/28up-nixon2/28up-nixon2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 476, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/28/upshot/28up-nixon2/28up-nixon2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 476}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/upshot/28up-nixon2/28up-nixon2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 812, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/upshot/28up-nixon2/28up-nixon2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1623, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/upshot/28up-nixon2/28up-nixon2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/28/upshot/28up-nixon2/28up-nixon2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/upshot/28up-nixon2/28up-nixon2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nixon and Pelé: No Meeting of the Minds', 'kicker': 'HistorySource', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Quick and Awkward Meeting Between a President and Pelé', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beschloss, Michael R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nixon, Richard Milhous', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pele (1940- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Watergate Affair', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-27T15:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Beschloss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Beschloss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Web Log', '_id': 'nyt://article/419c1719-ae92-5b21-9e3b-7ed65af0642f', 'word_count': 582, 'uri': 'nyt://article/419c1719-ae92-5b21-9e3b-7ed65af0642f'}, {'abstract': 'Sarah Gavlak — the premier gallery in the elite Florida winter retreat — heads west with a new space on Highland Avenue in Hollywood.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/27/art-sarah-gavlak-gallery-los-angeles-palm-beach/', 'snippet': 'Sarah Gavlak — the premier gallery in the elite Florida winter retreat — heads west with a new space on Highland Avenue in Hollywood.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most art dealers have opened their happy-go-lucky summer shows and are gearing up to close for the dog days come August. Last night, however, Sarah Gavlak — whose Gavlak Gallery in Palm Beach has survived many a balmy winter as the only game in town — opened a new space in Los Angeles. And this time, Gavlak has plenty of competition in her new backyard. The L.A. gallery occupies a former manufacturing plant on Highland Avenue below Santa Monica Boulevard — just a couple of storefronts up from Hannah Hoffman gallery, around the corner from Regen Projects, and just a block or so down from Kohn Gallery’s roomy new digs that opened just last month.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/t-magazine/27gavlak-mcgarry1/27gavlak-mcgarry1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/27/t-magazine/27gavlak-mcgarry1/27gavlak-mcgarry1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/t-magazine/27gavlak-mcgarry1/27gavlak-mcgarry1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 643, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/t-magazine/27gavlak-mcgarry1/27gavlak-mcgarry1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1719, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/t-magazine/27gavlak-mcgarry1/27gavlak-mcgarry1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/27/t-magazine/27gavlak-mcgarry1/27gavlak-mcgarry1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/t-magazine/27gavlak-mcgarry1/27gavlak-mcgarry1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLa