been charged with killing a man — he went on a search for the victim’s descendants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/29/nyregion/a-copper-a-dust-up-and-death.html', 'snippet': 'After Terrence Lavin discovered a long-hidden family secret — that his great-great-grandfather had been charged with killing a man — he went on a search for the victim’s descendants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I found it after reading through the indictment, consulting archival maps and applying the measurements where the original tenements once stood, in Chelsea. Now, on an innocuous patch of crab grass between the corner of a red brick building and a concrete walkway winding through the Chelsea-Elliott housing complex, I was standing on the spot where, 125 years ago, my great-great-grandfather killed a man.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/nyregion/29KILLING1/29KILLING1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 941, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/29/nyregion/29KILLING1/29KILLING1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 941}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/nyregion/29KILLING1/29KILLING1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 654, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/nyregion/29KILLING1/29KILLING1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1307, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/nyregion/29KILLING1/29KILLING1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': '