 suicide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/28/us/politics/tea-party-activist-arrested-in-mississippi-commits-suicide.html', 'snippet': 'The primary fight between Senator Thad Cochran and his Tea Party challenger descended into voter fraud accusations, and a tragic note was introduced when a Tea Party leader committed suicide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The long and bitter Republican primary fight between Senator Thad Cochran and his Tea Party challenger descended into accusations of voter fraud on Friday, with the defeated candidate, State Senator Chris McDaniel, making clear he would not accept the results anytime soon.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Voter-Fraud Claims and Activist’s Suicide Add to Turmoil in Mississippi', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fraud Claims and Tea Party Leader’s Suicide Add to Mississippi Turmoil', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2014)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mayfield, Mark', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cochran, Thad', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cochran, Rose', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McDaniel, Chris (1972- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mississippi', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-27T17:26:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Weisman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weisman', 'q