nied a front-page article about home foreclosures in Detroit. Two graphics editors explain how the project came about.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today, an ambitious interactive graphic accompanied a front-page article by Monica Davey about the high rate of home foreclosures in Detroit. The graphic was presented as a mosaic of the more than 43,000 properties that were subject to foreclosure this year. Haeyoun Park, a graphics editor for the national desk, and Matthew Bloch, a graphics and multimedia editor, worked on the project and shared some details about how it came to be.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/blogs/detroit-graphic/detroit-graphic-articleLarge.png', 'height': 333, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/27/blogs/detroit-graphic/detroit-graphic-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 333}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/blogs/detroit-graphic/detroit-graphic-jumbo.png', 'height': 568, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/blogs/detroit-graphic/detroit-graphic-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1137, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/27/blogs/detroit-graphic/detroit-graphic-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/27/blogs/detroit-graphic/detroit-graphic-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 