{'abstract': 'At a news conference, three of the five men whose convictions were overturned praised Mayor Bill de Blasio for settling their lawsuit against New York City.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/28/nyregion/3-freed-in-central-park-jogger-case-thank-supporters.html', 'snippet': 'At a news conference, three of the five men whose convictions were overturned praised Mayor Bill de Blasio for settling their lawsuit against New York City.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three of the five men whose convictions were overturned in the 1989 beating and rape of a female jogger in Central Park appeared in front of City Hall on Friday, thanking their supporters and praising Mayor Bill de Blasio for agreeing to settle their longstanding lawsuit against the city.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '3 Freed in Central Park Jogger Case Thank Supporters', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Settlement in Jogger Case, Plaintiffs Thank Supporters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Central Park Jogger Case (1989)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schweber, Nate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salaam, Yusef', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Richardson, Kevin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santana, Raymond', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'False Arrests, Convictions and Imprisonments', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCray, Antron', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wise, Kharey', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-27T21:03:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_