, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/fashion/29WEDDING3/29WEDDING3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/29/fashion/29WEDDING3/29WEDDING3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/29/fashion/29WEDDING3/29WEDDING3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Bride Didn’t Always Wear White', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Bride Didn’t Always Wear White', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Emmrich, Stuart', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dresses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Victoria and Albert Museum', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-27T21:46:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Emmrich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Emmrich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f61c2f0b-4f0a-5371-b076-a1c13035b1a5', 'word_count': 753, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f61c2f0b-4f0a-5371-b076-a1c13035b1a5'}, {'abstract': 'In “The Muscles in Our Toes,” by Stephen Belber, friends plot a rescue mission for a friend held by terrorists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/28/theater/the-muscles-in-our-toes-follows-friends-on-a-mission.html', 'snippet': 'In “The Muscles in Our Toes,” by Stephen Belber, friends plot a rescue mission for a friend held by terrorists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At most 25th high school reunions, the drama does not rise above the discovery that the prom queen got fat, or the mousy kid who disappeared into the scenery founded an Internet company valued at a few billion dollars. There’s much more in store for the friends reassembling to recall semi-halcyon days in “The Muscles in Our Toes,” a fairly preposterous play by Stephen Belber (“Tape,” “Match”) making its New York premiere in a Labyrinth Theater Company production directed by Anne Kauffman. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/arts/28MUSCLES/28MUSCLES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/28/arts/28MUSCLES/28MUSCLES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/arts/28MUSCLES/28MUSCLES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 715, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/arts/28MUSCLES/28MUSCLES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1429, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ