://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/29/arts/music/los-tigres-del-norte-breaks-boundaries.html', 'snippet': 'The California band Los Tigres del Norte, which has made more than 50 albums and sold millions of records, is all but invisible to mainstream English-speaking America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — About four hours before a Friday night show late last month, the five members of Los Tigres del Norte, the premier band in the accordion-driven musical genre known as norteño, were quietly eating dinner at the restaurant of their hotel here. None of the other diners seemed to have any notion of who they were, and neither did the staff — until a Spanish-speaking waiter spotted them and shyly approached their table.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The United States of Los Tigres', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The United States of Los Tigres', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Tigres del Norte', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-27T21:51:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Rohter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9bd7ded-35c9-5832-b5fb-ab8b8781890a', 'word_count': 1797, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9bd7ded-35c9-5832-b5fb-ab8b8781890a'}, {'abstract': 'A review of new albums by Rae Sremmurd, Luis Coronel, Becky G, White Lung, Cakes Da Killa and Against the Current.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/29/arts/music/new-releases-by-rae-sremmurd-becky-g-cakes-da-killa.html', 'snippet': 'A review of new albums b