 'nyt://article/63747b94-8ae2-50eb-87f7-31dfa1f83852'}, {'abstract': 'A report to President Obama from a top adviser points to a multitude of problems, just as demand for services is increasing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/28/us/report-finds-health-unit-of-va-needs-overhaul.html', 'snippet': 'A report to President Obama from a top adviser points to a multitude of problems, just as demand for services is increasing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Veterans Health Administration has a corrosive culture that has led to poor management, a history of retaliation toward employees, cumbersome and outdated technology, and a shortage of doctors, nurses and physical space to treat its patients, according to a review presented to President Obama on Friday by one of his top advisers on veterans’ issues.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Report Finds Health Unit of V.A. Needs Overhaul', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Report Finds Health Unit of V.A. Needs Overhaul', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oppel, Richard A Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Health Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nabors, Rob', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shinseki, Eric K', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-28T01:08:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear and Richard A. Oppel Jr', 'person': [{'first