ad_paragraph': 'My Sunday column is about the failure of our criminal justice system for kids, including the way we vastly over-rely on the juvenile detention toolbox and under-rely on the education, economic opportunity and early intervention toolboxes. As my column notes, the United States incarcerates kids at a rate 10 to 20 times higher than in some other industrialized countries; I should have added that it’s 100 times the rate of a few countries. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kids Behind Bars', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-06-28T20:33:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kristof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kristof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ea63979-5c10-5ab7-8c07-7170922ac12c', 'word_count': 325, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ea63979-5c10-5ab7-8c07-7170922ac12c'}, {'abstract': 'Paris', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/06/28/fashion/runway-mens/hermes-spring-2015-menswear.html', 'snippet': 'Paris', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paris', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/fashion/runway-mens/hermes-mens-slide-9566/hermes-mens-slide-9566-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/28/fashion/runway-mens/hermes-mens-slide-9566/hermes-mens-slide-9566-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/28/fashion/runway-me