36b-b337-069b1a490a35'}, {'abstract': 'Before the birth of my first baby, I asked my parents and my in-laws to get the T.D.A.P. vaccine. My mother and in-laws agreed. My father refused.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/29/the-battle-over-vaccinating-grandparents/', 'snippet': 'Before the birth of my first baby, I asked my parents and my in-laws to get the T.D.A.P. vaccine. My mother and in-laws agreed. My father refused.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I don’t understand why I need the whooping cough vaccine. I’ve raised kids. We have friends whose kids have raised kids. Our nieces and nephews have kids. Why is this the first time we’re hearing about grandparents getting vaccinated?”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/us/motherlode-baby-shots/motherlode-baby-shots-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/19/us/motherlode-baby-shots/motherlode-baby-shots-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/us/motherlode-baby-shots/motherlode-baby-shots-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/us/motherlode-baby-shots/motherlode-baby-shots-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1563, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/19/us/motherlode-baby-shots/motherlode-baby-shots-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/19/us/mothe