ww.nytimes.com/2014/06/30/opinion/pushback-on-home-care.html', 'snippet': 'A lawsuit against a new wage protection rule is the latest move in a misguided campaign by some states and groups representing home care agencies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The salvos keep coming from opponents of a new federal rule to ensure that home care workers are paid at least the minimum wage and time and a half for overtime. The rule, many years in the making, reverses a misguided policy from 1974 that has long denied home care workers those basic wage protections. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pushback on Home Care', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pushback on Home Care', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Home Health Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Minimum Wage', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-30T00:59:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3562c4d-b297-565a-9aa6-f284ff19da80', 'word_count': 353, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c3562c4d-b297-565a-9aa6-f284ff19da80'}, {'abstract': 'The Department of Education’s guidelines could bring more order to the process and help colleges meet federal requirements on safety.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/30/opinion/new-rules-to-address-campus-rape.html', 'snippet': 'The Department of Education’s guidelines could bring more order to the process and help colleges meet federal requirements on safet