69-597e-89ec-a9ceac38517d'}, {'abstract': 'David Ortiz hit a three-run home run in the third inning, the 450th homer of his career, as the Red Sox jumped on the rookie starter Chase Whitley.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/30/sports/long-a-tormentor-of-the-yankees-ortiz-adds-yet-another-dagger.html', 'snippet': 'David Ortiz hit a three-run home run in the third inning, the 450th homer of his career, as the Red Sox jumped on the rookie starter Chase Whitley.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the past decade of the Yankees-Red Sox rivalry, few things have endured quite like David Ortiz, the hulking Boston slugger who, even at age 38 and in his 18th major league season, continues to stir up some of his most inimitable qualities against his fiercest rivals.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/30/sports/30yankees3/30yankees3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/30/sports/30yankees3/30yankees3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/30/sports/30yankees3/30yankees3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/30/sports/30yankees3/30yankees3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/30/sports/30yankees3/30yankees3-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/