r for major and alumni giving at the Minneapolis College of Art and Design. And Monica Mason, outreach director, becomes program director.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Accounts and People of Note in the Advertising Industry', 'kicker': 'Webdenda', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Relations and Publicity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-30T12:34:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5f0b70c8-c576-57ee-8ad7-c4c98a3fa136', 'word_count': 858, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5f0b70c8-c576-57ee-8ad7-c4c98a3fa136'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the parties, the lawyers and the issues in the Hobby Lobby case.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/07/01/us/a-look-at-the-parties-and-the-issues-in-the-hobby-lobby-case.html', 'snippet': 'A look at the parties, the lawyers and the issues in the Hobby Lobby case.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Supreme Court on Monday is expected to rule on a pair of challenges to a part of President Obama’s health care law that requires many employers to provide insurance coverage for contraceptives. Here is a look at the parties, the lawyers and the issues in the case.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Questions and Answers on the Contraceptives Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major':