eaction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Sergei Filin, the Bolshoi Ballet director who suffered burns and a loss of vision in an acid attack in January 2013, is back at work after being hospitalized for an allergic reaction that led him to be put in intensive care on Friday.\xa0 The Russian news agency Interfax reported on Sunday that Mr. Filin had been released from the Sklifosovsky Research Institute. George Golukhov, the head of the Moscow Department of Health, was quoted as saying his condition was “normal.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bolshoi Director Back at Work After Hospitalization', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bolshoi Director Returns After Hospitalization', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Filin, Sergei', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bolshoi Ballet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-30T15:19:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roslyn Sulcas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roslyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sulcas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/81bf2ebe-33e7-5bbc-81f0-25f00b1718dc', 'word_count': 218, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81bf2ebe-33e7-5bbc-81f0-25f00b1718dc'}, {'abstract': 'The court’s action let stand a federal appeals court ruling that said California had an interest in banning professional treatments it considered harmful.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/07/01/us/supreme-court-declines-case-contesting-ban-on-gay-conversion-therapy.html', 'snippet': 'The court’s action let stand a federal appeals court ruling that said California had an interest in banning professional treatments it considered harmful.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Supreme Court declined on Monday to hear a challenge to a California law that bans “conversion therapy” aimed at changing the sexual orientation of gay and lesbian minors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Supreme Court Declines Case Contesting Ban on Gay ‘Conversion Therapy’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Liberty Counsel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Therapy and Rehabilitation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-30T15:22:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By David S. Joachim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Joachim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8869a39f-8368-530e-bfb2-ff370d1288ea', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8869a39f-8368-530e-bfb2-ff370d1288ea'}, {'abstract': 'This week, The New York Times will share stories of city summers from the archive. We’ll start with an article that might not pass muster today.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/30/new-york-summer-stories-in-1887-mosquitoes-by-myriads/', 'snippet': 'This week, The New York Times will share stories of city summers from the archive. We’ll start with an article that might not pass muster today.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s hot. It smells. The parks are crowded and so is Long Beach. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Summer Stories: In 1887, Mosquitoes by Myriads', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mosquitoes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-30T15:37:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Workman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Workman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd6c5c9e-7176-56d9-8545-bff8754fd2f0', 'word_count': 169, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd6c5c9e-7176-56d9-8545-bff8754fd2f0'}, {'abstract': 'India Ink will be moving to the World page of The New York Times.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/06/30/were-moving/', 'snippet': 'India Ink will be moving to the World page of The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From now on, you will find us at a new address: nytimes.com/world. We will continue to produce web-only India\xa0Ink\xa0sketches, analyses, narratives and news stories, but they will appear on the World page, along with the rest of the newspaper’s coverage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'We’re Moving', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-06-30T15:39:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/905d4b4c-